<node id="Reverse Transcription-PCR">
  <data key="d0">Reverse Transcription-PCR</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Reverse transcription-PCR is a gene expression analysis method used to demonstrate that mouse islets express MafA, c-Maf, and MafB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bf89ad08d3f81ffe84c9bf7f208c604b</data>
  <data key="d4">Members of the large Maf transcription family regulate insulin gene transcription in islet beta cells.</data>
