  <data key="d0">MafA Knockout Mice</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">MafA knockout mice are genetically engineered mice lacking MafA expression, which display normal islet morphology at birth, suggesting redundancy in large Maf factor function.</data>
