<node id="Embryonic Pancreas">
  <data key="d0">Embryonic Pancreas</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The embryonic pancreas is the developing pancreatic tissue in embryos; MafB is expressed before MafA in this context, and a MafB+ MafA− Ins+ intermediate cell stage exists during β-cell differentiation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d5e51c0312e54ad3757625ff1041f76</data>
