<node id="MafB+ Mafa− Ins+ Intermediate Cell">
  <data key="d0">MafB+ Mafa− Ins+ Intermediate Cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The MafB+ MafA− Ins+ intermediate cell is a proposed transitional cell state during embryonic β-cell differentiation, characterized by expression of MafB and insulin but not MafA.</data>
