<node id="Joslin Diabetes Center">
  <data key="d0">Joslin Diabetes Center</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Joslin Diabetes Center is a research institution affiliated with Harvard Medical School in Boston, Massachusetts, where the study was conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Joslin Diabetes Center is the source institution for the deposited dataset GSE121539 related to beta cell aging and diabetes.</data>
