<node id="MafB− Mafa+ Ins+ Cell">
  <data key="d0">MafB− Mafa+ Ins+ Cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The MafB− MafA+ Ins+ cell is the mature β-cell state following the differentiation transition from the MafB+ MafA− Ins+ intermediate, characterized by expression of MafA and insulin but not MafB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d5e51c0312e54ad3757625ff1041f76</data>
