<node id="Embryogenesis">
  <data key="d0">Embryogenesis</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Embryogenesis is the developmental period during which MafA and MafB are co-expressed in insulin+ β-cells, and MafB−/− animals are deficient in insulin+ and glucagon+ cell production.&lt;SEP&gt;Early developmental process during which senescence can be observed, representing an early manifestation of physiologically programmed senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Embryogenesis is a developmental process in which cellular senescence plays a beneficial role.&lt;SEP&gt;Embryogenesis is a critical process in which DNA demethylation via programmed BER plays an important role.</data>
