  <data key="d0">FoxA1/2</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">FoxA1/2 are winged-helix/forkhead transcription factors expressed broadly in pancreatic epithelial cells that contribute to β-cell formation and become confined to specific cellular domains during development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8</data>
