<node id="Microarray Profiling">
  <data key="d0">Microarray Profiling</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Microarray profiling is a gene expression analysis method used to identify genes regulated by MafB in wild-type and MafB−/− pancreata at embryonic day 18.5.&lt;SEP&gt;Microarray profiling is a genomic technique used to identify genes regulated by MafB, performed on wild-type and MafB−/− pancreata at embryonic day 18.5.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b9ed09558012a9cb8eba4b1efe943943</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.</data>
