  <data key="d0">Embryonic Day 18.5</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Embryonic day 18.5 is the developmental time point at which microarray profiling was performed on wild-type and MafB−/− pancreata to identify MafB-regulated genes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8</data>
