<node id="Acinar Cells">
  <data key="d0">Acinar Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Adult acinar cells are pancreatic exocrine cells that can be reprogrammed to β-like cells upon misexpression of a unique subset of transcription factors, specifically MafA, Pdx1, and Ngn3.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.</data>
