  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">19</data>
  <data key="d8">Acinar Cells</data>
  <data key="d9">3.644e-05</data>
  <data key="d10">0.0</data>
  <data key="d11">0.0</data>
</node>
<node id="Glucose Sensing">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Sensing</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose sensing is a key β-cell function associated with MafB-dependent genes and influenced by MafA in adult islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucose sensing is a key function of adult β-cells associated with MafA target genes, enabling appropriate insulin secretion in response to blood glucose levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic beta cell function involving detection of blood glucose levels to regulate insulin secretion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff8c5dc48dde6c3ccfdc01c9e025403d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f63ca40b092870f725a75e7a36045d8</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778561050</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
