<node id="Vesicle Formation">
  <data key="d0">Vesicle Formation</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Vesicle formation is a cellular process regulated by MafB in β-cells, involved in the packaging and secretion of hormones such as insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.</data>
