</node>
<node id="Hormone Processing">
  <data key="d0">Hormone Processing</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Hormone processing is a β-cell function regulated by MafB, involved in the maturation and processing of hormones including insulin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9693157a2d458ecc8255c49ec77d95f8</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.</data>
