<node id="Nnat">
  <data key="d0">Nnat</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Nnat is a gene whose mRNA expression is significantly reduced in MafAΔPanc, MafB−/−, and MafAΔPanc;MafB−/− mutant pancreata.&lt;SEP&gt;Nnat is a gene involved in insulin secretion that is activated primarily by MafB, serving as an instance where MafB is the primary activator.&lt;SEP&gt;Nnat is a candidate gene whose mRNA changes were independently verified in E18.5 MafB−/− and MafAΔPanc;MafB−/− pancreata by quantitative RT-PCR.&lt;SEP&gt;Nnat is a gene for which MafB was identified as the primary or exclusive activator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f82db25373e25b34bbbcfebc1c0f861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7f8610c162035d52f2edbe846e8a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff8c5dc48dde6c3ccfdc01c9e025403d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb7aaa2476f3163b5c3de684504f42b</data>
