<node id="INS1 β-Cells">
  <data key="d0">INS1 β-Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">INS1 β-cells are a β-cell line used in candidate gene studies to associate genes such as Gck, Pcsk1, and Glp1R with MafA control.&lt;SEP&gt;INS1 β-cells are a β-cell line in which overexpression of Slc30a8 enhances glucose-stimulated insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;INS1 β-cells are a β-cell line in which overexpression of Slc30a8 enhances glucose-stimulated insulin secretion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f82db25373e25b34bbbcfebc1c0f861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb7aaa2476f3163b5c3de684504f42b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7255d0eadb6b7f3a3a51c10b8ea742</data>
