adb909ac9a245bd8fb1b7b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ddf6c13fee09d00987476aa3c478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-822d03d11fbf61e2a25591e2663ef1ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68cd62913e543123e8319a7a70949910&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2efc110efa119e343b95df1abbd0a327&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6115fe960d3cc141101692d3cf027c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0386e6a8316aca2a67c3466442e7e1fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cba0d7fafdd66d2ffb133e04939d15f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9813efa6c9cd7902e394127ee79fac57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddac43d21e0426c8d61d02d10c0cb772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e8cbb766d17c90c84d2a9452a51a41e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43761b34ecc024bd90bfa8711c45a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044fb2d3ececa99a53eb87d2ee6bf18f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10bdc47e4d027606476b48a401061a27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5596e00050d9f0135f87252a0093e9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f09e5d1418f8ae04b43a24b97c1d52d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e181574d19e6f17c0fd64b0feecf8f9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce4f6e2d90d0c06e4549d7d45037298&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de2a35f76e08d5b7cddadbcc01954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15ab370ab273e97005ced113e59cc48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af17b436ff0aa3dd562bbc7e986cc909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e33cd1d99c96a7f6ffdd0fbea902670&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28a44d52c17c29e9741a935aa76e8afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c63b5ad461844f8e5d9a90f5dfc52f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce72a72ed1aaea72aac97c28374f8f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7af94fcbbc3d167377ece712218fa36b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35d7a41162ea60151fe17b4e60e06d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6204b07313b33d741c243f18ce86735&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dad82642ce24967122d02819b52a6f45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b39885796d53f3f69a4452a58c07c2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002f23b1d29df711e839459b4d6f0711</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.&lt;SEP&gt;Species-specific roles for the MAFA and MAFB transcription factors in regulating islet β cell identity.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB Is Important for Pancreatic β-Cell Maintenance under a MafA-Deficient Condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Stress-induced β cell early senescence confers protection against type 1 diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778564595</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">23</data>
  <data key="d8">Type 2 Diabetes / Insulin Resistance / High-Fat Diet</data>
  <data key="d9">0.01232819</data>
