</node>
<node id="MafAΔPanc Mutant">
  <data key="d0">MafAΔPanc Mutant</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">MafAΔPanc mutant refers to organisms with pancreas-specific deletion of MafA, showing reduced Slc30a8 and G6pc2 expression in islet β-cells.&lt;SEP&gt;MafAΔPanc is a mouse mutant with pancreas-specific loss of MafA, associated with insulin secretion defects and increased Rbp4 expression in δ-cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f7f8610c162035d52f2edbe846e8a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc7255d0eadb6b7f3a3a51c10b8ea742</data>
