  <data key="d10">8.4e-07</data>
  <data key="d11">0.01858173</data>
</node>
<node id="Δ-Cell">
  <data key="d0">Δ-Cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">δ-cells are pancreatic islet cells in which Rbp4 expression is activated in MafAΔPanc mice, potentially diminishing β-cell function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1f7f8610c162035d52f2edbe846e8a97</data>
  <data key="d4">MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.</data>
