<node id="C57BL/6J Mice">
  <data key="d0">C57BL/6J Mice</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">C57BL/6J mice were used for germline transmission screening after chimeric mice were bred with them.&lt;SEP&gt;C57BL/6J is a mouse background strain on which β-cell-specific deletion of Atf6α leads to mild glucose intolerance and decreased glucose-stimulated insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse strain fed control chow or HFD for 8 weeks to study diet-induced metabolic stress on beta-cell DNA damage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff8c5dc48dde6c3ccfdc01c9e025403d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9634b81ecdb467a2b26648246e5b5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dad82642ce24967122d02819b52a6f45</data>
