<node id="Vanderbilt University">
  <data key="d0">Vanderbilt University</data>
  <data key="d1">Organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Vanderbilt University is the institution associated with the Institutional Animal Care and Use Committee that approved the mouse studies, and the source of the Pdx15.5-Cre mice gift.&lt;SEP&gt;Vanderbilt University is the institution where Dr. Chris Wright works, who provided rabbit α-Pdx1 as a gift for the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Vanderbilt University is the primary institution affiliated with the majority of co-authors of this study, located in Nashville, TN.&lt;SEP&gt;Vanderbilt University is the institution associated with the lead contact Roland Stein and houses the Institutional Animal Care and Use Committee overseeing animal studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Vanderbilt University is the institution affiliated with David Jacobson, located in Nashville, Tennessee, USA, and associated with the Powers-Brissova laboratory.&lt;SEP&gt;Institution whose Institutional Animal Care and Use Committee (IACUC) approved all animal procedures in this study.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff8c5dc48dde6c3ccfdc01c9e025403d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e9c4875e9ee2b378c620275d81fe7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78596a38854a9e8f2c4ef9c3dfcbbfbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68488f40a0b43cd31dd09cb8c1939a9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39e1736c730a00c8edfab90d7dc64da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364a12c675ebfd67c468ab6fc47e6696</data>
