<node id="Ovation Aminoallyl Rna Amplification And Labeling System">
  <data key="d0">Ovation Aminoallyl Rna Amplification And Labeling System</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">The Ovation Aminoallyl RNA Amplification and Labeling System (NuGEN Technologies) was used to amplify RNA samples prior to microarray analysis.</data>
