  <data key="d2">Microarray analysis using PancChip 6.1 was performed on RNA from E18.5 pancreas anlagen of wild-type and mutant mice to examine gene expression profiles.&lt;SEP&gt;Microarray analysis is a gene expression profiling technique used to identify genes regulated by MafA in MafaΔpanc and control islets.</data>
