  <data key="d2">Linco Research is a supplier of primary antibodies used in immunohistochemistry, including guinea pig α-insulin, guinea pig α-glucagon, and guinea pig α-pancreatic polypeptide.&lt;SEP&gt;Linco Research is a supplier of research antibodies, providing mouse α-insulin, guinea pig α-glucagon, and guinea pig α-pancreatic polypeptide used in immunolabeling studies.&lt;SEP&gt;A supplier of primary antibodies used in immunostaining, including guinea pig α-insulin and guinea pig/rabbit α-glucagon antibodies.</data>
