  <data key="d2">Neuronatin is a downstream target of β2/NeuroD1 in the pancreas, playing crucial roles in insulin secretion and high glucose-induced apoptosis in pancreatic β-cells, and is involved in glucose-mediated insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Neuronatin is a gene used as a probe in in situ hybridization assays to study gene expression in pancreatic tissue.</data>
