<node id="Glucokinase">
  <data key="d0">Glucokinase</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucokinase is an enzyme in pancreatic β-cells whose regulation is studied from basics to therapeutics.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucokinase plays a key role in glucose sensing in pancreatic islet beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Key enzyme in pancreatic beta cell glucose sensing playing a critical role in glycolytic regulation.</data>
