<node id="Endocrine Pancreas">
  <data key="d0">Endocrine Pancreas</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The endocrine pancreas is the hormone-secreting portion of the pancreas whose development involves transcription factors including Arx, Pax4, Ngn3, and various Maf family members.&lt;SEP&gt;The endocrine pancreas is the portion of the pancreas responsible for hormone secretion, including insulin, whose development is regulated by transcription factors such as Arx, Pax4, and MafB.&lt;SEP&gt;The hormone-secreting portion of the pancreas, including islets of Langerhans, whose formation, function, and failure are influenced by epigenetic regulation.</data>
