<node id="Confocal Microscopy">
  <data key="d0">Confocal Microscopy</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Confocal microscopy (LSM510, Carl Zeiss) was used to acquire immunofluorescence images of pancreatic sections in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging method used for measurement of co-localization of objects in dual-colour confocal images.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging method used alongside immunohistochemistry to confirm beta cell marker expression in CR islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Confocal microscopy is used to validate the impact of CR on beta cell autophagy via staining with LC3I-II and LAMP1 markers.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging method used to assess autophagy markers LC3I-II, LAMP1, p62, and colocalization studies in CR and AL islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging method used with a Leica Stellaris X5 confocal microscope to image immunostained FFPE mouse pancreas slides.&lt;SEP&gt;Imaging method used for acquisition of 3D image stacks of autophagy and mitochondrial markers with Lightning-confocal mode.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41e9c4875e9ee2b378c620275d81fe7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0c13c5a18e2c5037815818d22c48a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af08dcd3bdc472cb74376c18c72cf9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cadc21c6ca916dd06510987c1b7dbf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f39153d9f864070e17a74724a6c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0178968ab91760930c812723c60d342b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345</data>
