<node id="Stxbp1 (Munc18-1)">
  <data key="d0">Stxbp1 (Munc18-1)</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Stxbp1, also known as Munc18-1, is a protein effector of granule release that specifically regulates first-phase insulin secretion and is regulated by MafA; its expression is diminished in MafaΔpanc β-cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f67b6052ac2da6848aaabbd71f9d4d53</data>
  <data key="d4">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.</data>
