<node id="Human Embryonic Stem Cell">
  <data key="d0">Human Embryonic Stem Cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Human embryonic stem cells can be differentiated in vitro into insulin-positive (Ins+) cells that are MafB+ but lack MafA, resulting in impaired glucose-stimulated insulin secretion until transplantation into mice triggers MafA expression.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f67b6052ac2da6848aaabbd71f9d4d53</data>
