  <data key="d0">Gene Ontology Enrichment Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Gene ontology enrichment analysis is a bioinformatic method applied to MafaΔpanc and control islet microarray data to identify affected cellular functions and molecular activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Gene ontology enrichment analysis is a bioinformatics method applied to MafaΔpanc and control islet microarray data to identify affected biological processes and molecular functions.</data>
