<node id="Plasma Membrane">
  <data key="d0">Plasma Membrane</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The plasma membrane is the cellular boundary where insulin granules predock prior to release; the number of predocked granules on the plasma membrane is reduced by more than 50% in MafaΔpanc β-cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f67b6052ac2da6848aaabbd71f9d4d53</data>
