  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The islet of Langerhans is a structure within the pancreas containing several hormone-producing cell types critical to glucose homeostasis, including β-cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic islet structure containing multiple cell types studied extensively for gene expression, dysfunction, and diabetes risk.</data>
