  <data key="d2">MafaΔpanc mice are pancreas-specific MafA knockout mice in which islet cell organization, β-cell mass, and β-cell function are influenced by 3 weeks of age.&lt;SEP&gt;MafaΔpanc mice are pancreas-specific MafA deletion mutant mice used to study the functional significance of MafA to β-cells and the impact on islet cell organization, β-cell mass, and β-cell function.</data>
