  <data key="d2">Gata4 is a zinc finger transcription factor expressed in early pancreatic epithelial cells whose expression ceases after birth.&lt;SEP&gt;GATA4 is a transcription factor that, together with GATA6, controls mouse pancreas organogenesis; its deletion causes pancreatic agenesis.</data>
