  <data key="d2">Ghrelin is a hormone produced by ε-cells within the islet of Langerhans.&lt;SEP&gt;Ghrelin is a non–β cell hormone that can be misexpressed upon deficiency in key islet transcription factors, reflecting intraislet cell plasticity.</data>
