  <data key="d2">MafaΔpanc;Mafb+/− is a double mutant mouse model combining pancreas-specific MafA deletion with heterozygous MafB loss, showing more severe and earlier defects in islet architecture and glucose tolerance than MafaΔpanc alone.&lt;SEP&gt;MafaΔpanc;Mafb+/− is a compound mutant mouse model with pancreas-specific Mafa deletion and heterozygous Mafb loss, showing more dramatic effects than MafaΔpanc alone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94526413b6fbcf0ec99212789cec9eea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ee443fb4c37f27d6895254d3f95c708</data>
