<node id="Slc30a8−/− Islets">
  <data key="d0">Slc30a8−/− Islets</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Slc30a8−/− islets are islets lacking the Slc30a8 zinc transporter gene, which show a deficiency in mature insulin granule formation similar to MafaΔpanc β-cells.</data>
