  <data key="d0">Postnatal Period</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The postnatal period refers to the time after birth during which MafA becomes essential for regulating β-cell function, gene expression, and islet architecture, particularly around 3 weeks of age.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ee443fb4c37f27d6895254d3f95c708</data>
  <data key="d4">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778561525</data>
