<node id="MafaΔpanc:Mafb+/− Mutant">
  <data key="d0">MafaΔpanc:Mafb+/− Mutant</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The compound MafaΔpanc:Mafb+/− mutant is a mouse model combining MafA pancreatic deletion and MafB haploinsufficiency, showing more severe defects than MafaΔpanc alone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-75261aabfd0eeb269665c62f36dfeb2e</data>
  <data key="d4">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.</data>
