<node id="β-Cell Turnover">
  <data key="d0">β-Cell Turnover</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">β-cell turnover refers to the renewal and loss of beta cells, studied in the context of aging.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ecc1e3f157d04d78962c82537c6b7d9</data>
  <data key="d4">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.</data>
