</node>
<node id="Islet Cell Organization">
  <data key="d0">Islet Cell Organization</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Islet cell organization refers to the structural arrangement of cells within pancreatic islets, influenced by MafA as demonstrated in MafaΔpanc mice by 3 weeks of age.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3ecc1e3f157d04d78962c82537c6b7d9</data>
  <data key="d4">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.</data>
