  <data key="d2">AS42 is an avian transforming retrovirus that carries the v-maf oncogene.&lt;SEP&gt;Avian transforming retrovirus that carries the v-MAF oncogene and causes musculoaponeurotic fibrosarcoma in chickens.</data>
