<node id="Ser65">
  <data key="d0">Ser65</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Ser65 is a priming phosphorylation site within the transactivation domain of MAFA, whose phosphorylation is prevented when Ser64 is mutated.&lt;SEP&gt;Ser65 is the priming phosphorylation site in the MAFA N-terminal transactivation domain; its phosphorylation enables GSK3-mediated sequential phosphorylation of neighboring residues.&lt;SEP&gt;Ser65 is the priming kinase phosphorylation site neighboring Ser64 in MAFA, whose phosphorylation is impaired by the p.Ser64Phe mutation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-61ea436af2c14f0df238edb6a5db2bea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71db066aa18a18c64b2b33ad26f7bfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6854465a5ab40a3dbe223209e2c5cd66</data>
