  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-Myc antibody is used in immunoblotting to detect transfected MAFA-Myc protein levels in EndoC-βH1 cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti-Myc antibody (clone 9E10, Roche) is used in immunoblotting to detect Myc-tagged MAFA proteins in cycloheximide chase experiments.</data>
