  <data key="d0">MAFA mRNA</data>
  <data key="d1">Data</data>
  <data key="d2">MAFA mRNA levels were measured in transfected cells and found to show no significant difference between wild-type and p.Ser64Phe mutant constructs, confirming the posttranscriptional nature of the effect on protein turnover.</data>
