  <data key="d2">Subject III/3 from family 2 is a patient who was diagnosed with gestational diabetes at age 27, later developed hyperinsulinemic hypoglycemia at age 55, and was diagnosed with multiple pancreatic neuroendocrine tumors on 18F-DOPA PET imaging.</data>
