  <data key="d0">18F-DOPA PET Imaging</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">18F-DOPA PET imaging is a nuclear imaging technique used to diagnose and localize multiple pancreatic neuroendocrine tumors in patients with MAFA mutation-positive insulinomatosis.</data>
