</node>
<node id="Congenital Glaucoma">
  <data key="d0">Congenital Glaucoma</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Congenital glaucoma is an ocular condition observed in homozygous MAFA p.Ser64Phe patient IV/2 from Family 1, born to consanguineous parents.&lt;SEP&gt;Congenital glaucoma is an eye disorder present in subjects IV/2 and III/16 from family 1, associated with the MAFA mutation in homozygous and heterozygous patients respectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71db066aa18a18c64b2b33ad26f7bfab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-348e687c811009b30863b17f466ac662</data>
  <data key="d4">MAFA missense mutation causes familial insulinomatosis and diabetes mellitus.</data>
