<node id="Insulinogenic Index">
  <data key="d0">Insulinogenic Index</data>
  <data key="d1">Data</data>
  <data key="d2">The insulinogenic index is a measure of insulin secretion calculated from baseline and 30-min glucose and insulin levels; subject IV/2 from family 2 had an insulinogenic index of 37.6 pmol/mmol, indicating impaired insulin secretion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71db066aa18a18c64b2b33ad26f7bfab</data>
  <data key="d4">MAFA missense mutation causes familial insulinomatosis and diabetes mellitus.</data>
