  <data key="d2">Sulphonylureas are oral medications used alongside metformin for diabetes management in MAFA p.Ser64Phe mutation carriers.&lt;SEP&gt;Sulphonylureas are a class of medications used to treat diabetes; subject III/3 from family 2 was treated with sulphonylureas between ages 33 and 35 for impaired glucose tolerance.</data>
