<node id="Glaucoma">
  <data key="d0">Glaucoma</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Glaucoma is an ocular condition reported in four patients from the index family carrying the p.Ser64Phe MAFA mutation.&lt;SEP&gt;An ocular condition observed in subjects with the p.Ser64Phe MAFA mutation, linked to MAFA's role in lens and anterior segment development.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06849490a7a3c085d30a2a392584bd67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e531f038e6fcc1cbb89c2336af984719</data>
