</node>
<node id="Sporadic Insulinomatosis">
  <data key="d0">Sporadic Insulinomatosis</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Sporadic insulinomatosis refers to nine cases of insulinomatosis without familial inheritance, in which germline or somatic MAFA pathogenic variants were not detected.&lt;SEP&gt;Sporadic insulinomatosis refers to cases of insulinomatosis with no familial association; nine patients with sporadic insulinomatosis were examined, and no germline or somatic MAFA mutations were identified in these individuals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06849490a7a3c085d30a2a392584bd67&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-348e687c811009b30863b17f466ac662</data>
  <data key="d4">MAFA missense mutation causes familial insulinomatosis and diabetes mellitus.</data>
