  <data key="d0">Quail Neuroretina Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Quail neuroretina cells are a cell type used in vitro to demonstrate the oncogenic transformation potential of MAFA, which induced their proliferation when overexpressed.</data>
