</node>
<node id="MAFA Protein Stability">
  <data key="d0">MAFA Protein Stability</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">MAFA protein stability refers to the resistance of MAFA protein to degradation; the p.Ser64Phe mutation profoundly increases MAFA protein stability under both high and low glucose concentrations in β-cell lines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-06849490a7a3c085d30a2a392584bd67</data>
  <data key="d4">MAFA missense mutation causes familial insulinomatosis and diabetes mellitus.</data>
