  <data key="d0">ABCC8</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">ABCC8 is a potassium channel gene whose mutations are associated with both diabetes and transient congenital hyperinsulinism, cited as a parallel to the dual phenotype caused by the p.Ser64Phe MAFA mutation.</data>
