  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Gal4-Ser64Phe is a chimeric protein used in experiments to assess the transactivation activity of the p.Ser64Phe MAFA mutation, showing greater activity than Gal4-WT MAFA in INS-1 β-cells.</data>
