  <data key="d2">The Student's t test is a statistical method used to analyze luciferase and qPCR experimental data using GraphPad Prism v5.&lt;SEP&gt;Student's t test is a statistical method used to compare results between two groups in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;An unpaired 2-tailed Student's t test was used to analyze differences between groups in the statistical analysis of the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Unpaired two-tailed statistical test used for two-group comparisons.&lt;SEP&gt;Student's t test is a statistical method used to compare two groups in animal experiments and IHC microscopy data.</data>
