<node id="Human Islet β-Cell">
  <data key="d0">Human Islet β-Cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Human islet β-cells sustainably express the MAFB transcription factor and show weak MAFA protein production in juvenile populations, distinguishing them from mouse β-cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78596a38854a9e8f2c4ef9c3dfcbbfbd</data>
  <data key="d4">Examining How the MAFB Transcription Factor Affects Islet β-Cell Function Postnatally.</data>
