  <data key="d11">0.0069073</data>
</node>
<node id="MAFA/MAFB Heterodimer">
  <data key="d0">MAFA/MAFB Heterodimer</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The MAFA/MAFB heterodimer is a protein complex found in human adult β-cells, suggested to be functionally equivalent to the mouse MafA homodimer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78596a38854a9e8f2c4ef9c3dfcbbfbd</data>
  <data key="d4">Examining How the MAFB Transcription Factor Affects Islet β-Cell Function Postnatally.</data>
