<node id="Mouse Model">
  <data key="d0">Mouse Model</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">A mouse model was developed to ectopically express MafB in adult mouse β-cells using MafA transcriptional control sequences to study the effect of MAFB on β-cell function.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental animal model used to study beta-cell biology, senescence, and diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse models used to study beta cell senescence across T1D, T2D, and MODY contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Experimental animal model used to study beta-cell biology, senescence, and diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse models used to study beta cell senescence across T1D, T2D, and MODY contexts.</data>
