<node id="MafA Transcriptional Control Sequences">
  <data key="d0">MafA Transcriptional Control Sequences</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">MafA transcriptional control sequences are regulatory DNA elements used to drive ectopic expression of MafB in adult mouse β-cells in the developed mouse model.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78596a38854a9e8f2c4ef9c3dfcbbfbd</data>
  <data key="d4">Examining How the MAFB Transcription Factor Affects Islet β-Cell Function Postnatally.</data>
