  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">11</data>
  <data key="d8">Mouse Model / National Institute Of Diabetes And Digestive And Kidney Diseases / JDRF</data>
  <data key="d9">0.00010697</data>
  <data key="d10">0.0</data>
  <data key="d11">0.00024883</data>
</node>
<node id="Mouse Mutant Lacking MafA">
  <data key="d0">Mouse Mutant Lacking MafA</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">A mouse mutant lacking MafA in β-cells was used to test whether MafB alone could rescue islet β-cell defects, which it was unable to do.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78596a38854a9e8f2c4ef9c3dfcbbfbd</data>
  <data key="d4">Examining How the MAFB Transcription Factor Affects Islet β-Cell Function Postnatally.</data>
