  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-glucagon antibody is used in histological analysis to measure the number and percentage of glucagon-positive cells in pancreatic islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Anti-glucagon antibody is used in histological analysis to identify and quantify glucagon-positive cells in pancreatic islets.&lt;SEP&gt;An antibody from Cell Signaling (#2760S) used for immunostaining to detect glucagon in pancreatic sections.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45b0e9a843120dd461f5ba7ec823e41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5afc163e9261bd9f96c6156bfdb27585&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40bbefacfceda2b6335fdb6310e2f7ae</data>
