<node id="Fasting Blood Glucose">
  <data key="d0">Fasting Blood Glucose</data>
  <data key="d1">Data</data>
  <data key="d2">Fasting blood glucose (FBG) levels were measured and found comparable across different mouse genotypes over 20 weeks.&lt;SEP&gt;Fasting blood glucose levels were measured before and after HFD treatment; A0B0 mice showed significantly elevated levels compared to other groups after 4 months of HFD.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45b0e9a843120dd461f5ba7ec823e41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5afc163e9261bd9f96c6156bfdb27585</data>
