<node id="Cleaved Caspase 3">
  <data key="d0">Cleaved Caspase 3</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">An apoptotic-cell marker used to stain islets; significantly increased in proportion in A0B0 islets compared to WT, indicating heightened cell apoptosis in A0B0 mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Cleaved caspase 3 is a marker of apoptosis used in immunohistochemistry experiments to detect apoptotic cells in pancreatic tissue sections.</data>
