<node id="HFD">
  <data key="d0">HFD</data>
  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">High-fat diet treatment used to induce metabolic stress in mice; aggravates glucose intolerance and causes diabetes in A0B0 mice after 5 months.&lt;SEP&gt;High-fat diet used in mouse models of diabetes where female sex confers relative protection from disease compared to males.&lt;SEP&gt;High-fat diet treatment used to induce obesity, insulin resistance, and beta-cell senescence in mouse models.&lt;SEP&gt;High-fat diet used in mouse models of diabetes where female sex confers relative protection from disease compared to males.&lt;SEP&gt;High-fat diet treatment used to induce obesity, insulin resistance, and beta-cell senescence in mouse models.&lt;SEP&gt;High-fat diet used to induce beta cell proliferation and metabolic stress in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;High-fat diet condition for islets used in MIMS-EM beta cell age quantification studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7568462935971fd17472cf21ed7b8a2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8304b17dc893b8c9bfb7bfdb03703396&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bcadefd5324392c8a202934109c8c242&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002f23b1d29df711e839459b4d6f0711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ed3d214b295f4a8cccdca98b3822e0</data>
