  <data key="d0">Cyphert Et Al.</data>
  <data key="d1">Person</data>
  <data key="d2">Researchers who demonstrated that expressing the MafB homodimer in MafAΔβ mice did not rescue glucose tolerance and also overexpressed MafB in mouse adult β cells using MafA transcriptional-control sequences.&lt;SEP&gt;Cyphert et al. are researchers who overexpressed MafB in mouse adult β cells using MafA transcriptional-control sequences to mimic the human condition in mice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5afa9fdb0e4f653f1c7825c0b258326d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d01061347ba219119efa4109d89e71f</data>
