<node id="ΒTC3 Cells">
  <data key="d0">ΒTC3 Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">βTC3 cells are human β-cell lines in which overexpression of MafB resulted in increased cell proliferation by upregulating cell cycle regulators such as cyclin D2 and cyclin B.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5afa9fdb0e4f653f1c7825c0b258326d</data>
