<node id="ImageJ">
  <data key="d0">ImageJ</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">ImageJ is software used to manually determine the number of hormone-positive cells per islet and to measure islet diameters in this study.&lt;SEP&gt;ImageJ is a software tool used for image analysis, including measuring islet diameters and quantifying cellular data in pancreatic tissue studies.&lt;SEP&gt;ImageJ is image analysis software used to quantify SA-β-gal+ islets per pancreas section and average SA-β-gal+ area per cell.&lt;SEP&gt;ImageJ is a software developed by NIH used to quantitate immunoblots and perform quantification of protein signals and nuclear counts in immunofluorescence images.&lt;SEP&gt;Image analysis software derived from NIH Image, used for 25 years of image analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Software used to manually count Ins+, Ins+Ki67+, and Ins+H2AX+ cells in islet images</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5afa9fdb0e4f653f1c7825c0b258326d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb31cc9ec659a6d29b2ec1e3870fb57b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc527b8db70f9b6c3c8648c4a33df392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667c57ab63de668da1132b51f1e9f411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e953ac093714735fa9b5b27463bf5dff</data>
  <data key="d4">MafB Is Important for Pancreatic β-Cell Maintenance under a MafA-Deficient Condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.&lt;SEP&gt;Species-specific roles for the MAFA and MAFB transcription factors in regulating islet β cell identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Calorie restriction increases insulin sensitivity to promote beta cell homeostasis and longevity in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Developmental control of DNA damage responses in α- and β-cells shapes the selective beta-cell susceptibility in diabetes.</data>
