  <data key="d2">MafA-MafB heterodimers are protein complexes that can function like MafA homodimers to regulate human adult β cells, as demonstrated by Cyphert et al.&lt;SEP&gt;MafA-MafB heterodimers can function like MafA homodimers to regulate human adult β cells.</data>
