<node id="Β-Cell Apoptosis">
  <data key="d0">Β-Cell Apoptosis</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The programmed death of β cells, which was detected at increased levels in A0B0 islets under HFD conditions, potentially linked to MafB's known role in preventing apoptosis in macrophages.&lt;SEP&gt;β-cell apoptosis refers to the programmed cell death of pancreatic β cells, which was increased in A0B0 mice, contributing to a decreased number of insulin-positive β cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d01061347ba219119efa4109d89e71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e0ae079210c3ef99872d0747c5a9b88</data>
