<node id="Macrophages">
  <data key="d0">Macrophages</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Immune cells in which MafB is known to act as a regulator to prevent apoptosis under specific conditions, providing context for understanding MafB's potential role in β-cell apoptosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Macrophages are immune cells assessed by F4/80 staining in flow cytometry, showing a non-significant trend toward decreased percentage in the pancreata of Atf6β−/− mice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1d01061347ba219119efa4109d89e71f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c625d74e06abff522b8eb3d76df6ae32</data>
