<node id="Pancreatic β Cells">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatic β Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatic β cells are insulin-producing cells located in the islets of Langerhans that synthesize and secrete insulin in response to elevated blood glucose to maintain blood glucose homeostasis.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic β cells are located in the islets of Langerhans and are responsible for synthesizing and secreting insulin in response to elevated blood glucose and nutrition.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e0ae079210c3ef99872d0747c5a9b88</data>
