  <data key="d11">0.02051804</data>
</node>
<node id="Islets Of Langerhans">
  <data key="d0">Islets Of Langerhans</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The islets of Langerhans are clusters of cells in the pancreas that contain β cells and α cells responsible for insulin and glucagon production.&lt;SEP&gt;The islets of Langerhans are clusters of cells in the pancreas that contain β cells responsible for insulin production.&lt;SEP&gt;Clusters of endocrine cells in the pancreas, including α and β cells, with unique cytoarchitecture that has implications for islet cell function.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic microstructures containing beta cells, macrophages, and dendritic cells, central to diabetes pathogenesis and autoimmunity.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic structures containing endocrine cells including beta and alpha cells, essential for controlling metabolic responses at the whole organismal level.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic structures containing endocrine cells including beta and alpha cells, essential for controlling metabolic responses at the whole organismal level.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e0ae079210c3ef99872d0747c5a9b88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f64af938dff7c5f186bd7024d92cbc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d13aa78bf917b6b3ed2e772b6f010e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f87338453daad7a9a4624ce798bcf6e</data>
  <data key="d4">Stress-induced β cell early senescence confers protection against type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB Is Important for Pancreatic β-Cell Maintenance under a MafA-Deficient Condition.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778564597</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
