<node id="Pancreatic Progenitor Cells">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatic Progenitor Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Pancreatic progenitor cells are embryonic cells from which both α and β cells develop; MafB begins to be expressed in these cells around embryonic day 10.5.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd</data>
