<node id="MafA-Deficient Adult Mice">
  <data key="d0">MafA-Deficient Adult Mice</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">MafA-deficient adult mice are a mouse model lacking MafA expression, showing reduced insulin secretion genes, fasting hyperglycemia, and impaired glucose-stimulated insulin secretion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd</data>
