<node id="MafB Knockout Embryos">
  <data key="d0">MafB Knockout Embryos</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">MafB knockout embryos are embryos lacking MafB expression, displaying decreased insulin-positive cell numbers during embryonic development, an effect that disappears after birth.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd</data>
  <data key="d4">MafB Is Important for Pancreatic β-Cell Maintenance under a MafA-Deficient Condition.</data>
