<node id="Glucose Tolerance Test (IpGTT)">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Tolerance Test (IpGTT)</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">The glucose tolerance test (ipGTT) is an intraperitoneal test performed to assess glucose metabolism in mice after glucose loading.&lt;SEP&gt;The intraperitoneal glucose tolerance test (ipGTT) is a method used to assess blood glucose clearance in mice after intraperitoneal loading with 2 g glucose/kg following a 16-hour fast.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9aad668b81389b88364235018ee9c389</data>
