  <data key="d0">Immunofluorescence Staining</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Immunofluorescence staining is a technique used to confirm MafB deletion from β cells in CKO mice at the embryonic stage.&lt;SEP&gt;Immunofluorescence staining is a method used to visualize protein expression in human pancreata, mouse pancreata, and treated EndoC-βH1/2 cells using fluorophore-conjugated secondary antibodies and DAPI nuclear staining.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-968f694e317648c82a07ee150e63adbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667c57ab63de668da1132b51f1e9f411</data>
