  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Postnatal day 7 (P7) is the developmental time point at which blood glucose and insulin content were measured in MafB CKO and control mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Postnatal day 7 (P7) is a neonatal developmental timepoint at which fasting blood glucose levels and insulin content were measured in MafB CKO mice and control mice.</data>
