  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin-positive cells are beta cells within pancreatic islets detected by insulin antibody staining; their proportion per islet was drastically reduced in A0B0 mice (37%) compared to WT (76%) and A0B2 (59%) mice under HFD conditions.</data>
