  <data key="d0">Blood Glucose Level</data>
  <data key="d1">Data</data>
  <data key="d2">Blood glucose level is a key measurement used to assess glucose tolerance and metabolic health across different mouse genotypes.&lt;SEP&gt;Blood glucose level is a measured parameter in HFD-treated mice; A0B0 mice showed significantly elevated fasting blood glucose and impaired clearance, remaining at 800 mg/dl at 4 hours post-glucose administration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9aad668b81389b88364235018ee9c389&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5afc163e9261bd9f96c6156bfdb27585</data>
