<node id="Body Weight">
  <data key="d0">Body Weight</data>
  <data key="d1">Data</data>
  <data key="d2">Body weight was measured and found comparable across different mouse genotypes over 20 weeks, indicating no significant metabolic differences in growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Body weight is a measured parameter tracked over 5 months of HFD feeding across different mouse genotypes, with A0B0 mice tending to have higher values.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse body mass measured after 2 months on AL, CR, or diluted diet; significant changes observed under CR in female mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse body mass monitored across diet groups; CR-AL mice show significant weight gain after resuming AL diet.&lt;SEP&gt;Phenotypic measure that is lower in CR mice due to reduced fat content, observed after both 2 and 12 months on diet.</data>
