  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">A0B0 mice are genetically engineered mice in which MafB is specifically deleted from β cells in addition to MafA deficiency, used to study MafB function in adult β cells under MafA-deficient conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4e0ae079210c3ef99872d0747c5a9b88</data>
