<node id="Pancreatic β Cell">
  <data key="d0">Pancreatic β Cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin-producing cells of the pancreatic islets that are enriched with MafA and are central to glucose homeostasis and insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin-secreting cells of the pancreatic islets whose function, aging, senescence, differentiation, and transcriptional regulation are central topics across the referenced studies.</data>
