<node id="PI3K">
  <data key="d0">PI3K</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">A kinase involved in regulating metabolism and ageing.&lt;SEP&gt;PI3K is part of the PI3K-mTOR signaling pathway through which erythromycin attenuates oxidative stress-induced cellular senescence in COPD.&lt;SEP&gt;PI3K is a survival pathway factor whose targeting by RNAi reduces viability of senescent cells.</data>
