<node id="DESeq2">
  <data key="d0">DESeq2</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">DESeq2 is a widely used computational and statistical tool designed for differential gene expression analysis, primarily applied to RNA sequencing (RNA-seq) data. Its core methodology centers on the moderated estimation of fold change and dispersion, enabling robust and reliable identification of differentially expressed genes across experimental conditions.

From a statistical standpoint, DESeq2 employs the Wald test for differential expression testing and supports multiple testing correction via the Benjamini-Hochberg procedure. Common thresholds applied in conjunction with DESeq2 include a log2(fold change) cutoff of 1 and a false discovery rate (FDR) of less than 0.05, ensuring stringent control over false positives in large-scale genomic studies.

DESeq2 is developed by the Love Lab, and a specific version referenced in the literature is v1.36.0. This version has been applied to perform differential gene expression testing on pseudobulked RNA count data, aggregating single-cell RNA-seq data across cell types and donors. Its applications span a variety of comparisons, including those involving cell type, sex, race, and disease status — such as comparisons between type 2 diabetes (T2D) and non-diabetic cells.

In summary, DESeq2 serves as a comprehensive statistical framework for RNA-seq differential expression analysis, integrating moderated estimation techniques, hypothesis testing, and multiple comparison corrections to deliver accurate and interpretable results in diverse biological and clinical research contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Tool using a Wald statistical test for differential expression and accessibility analyses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3f64af938dff7c5f186bd7024d92cbc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82e08f93585dc5d50ccfbac2feb8d206&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f38c4d8fe95ae0a2b5cc05069361348&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78c6090d91c84168c42d7ba3a2808633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3982c3cb7b00162818de82027a853e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7913917fca6b789f10e2948623ce222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0238834380bfb40677324883af3e3004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c41ef398df926f1c888f284aff2a98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d48756321bdf8ef533359c0655a3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e348a0adb909ac9a245bd8fb1b7b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ddf6c13fee09d00987476aa3c478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2efc110efa119e343b95df1abbd0a327&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4f6cfb9180aade52c8cb84446ced85</data>
