<node id="Insulin Tolerance Test">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Tolerance Test</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin tolerance tests were performed on MafAS64F/+ mice and showed no difference in peripheral tissue insulin sensitivity compared to controls.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin tolerance testing involves intraperitoneal injection of insulin into fasted mice and measuring blood glucose levels over time.&lt;SEP&gt;Intraperitoneal insulin tolerance test performed in overnight fasted mice to measure insulin sensitivity.</data>
