  <data key="d2">A referenced study by Gorgoulis et al. (2019) providing context for cellular senescence in development, maturation, and organismal aging.&lt;SEP&gt;A research publication cited in the context of SASP factors inducing senescence by reprogramming neighboring cells in a cell non-autonomous manner.</data>
