  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">5-week-old WT and MafAS64F/+ male and female mice used in the study, representing an age at which a clear delineation of phenotypes was observed for RNA-seq and Ca2+ handling experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-df94a97c87154646f3ffd59dd4b312d0</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
