<node id="Ovariectomy">
  <data key="d0">Ovariectomy</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Ovariectomy is the surgical removal of ovaries performed on female MafAS64F/+ mice at 3 weeks of age to investigate whether estrogen regulates the mutant sex-biased activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Ovariectomy is a surgical procedure performed on WT and MafAS64F/+ female mice at 3 weeks of age to remove endogenous ovarian hormones and prevent sexual maturity completion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc527b8db70f9b6c3c8648c4a33df392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63a4c12087ceb7cec876e14e7fc45727</data>
