<node id="Statistical Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Statistical Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Statistical significance was determined using two-tailed Student t test, one-way ANOVA, two-way ANOVA, and Tukey post hoc test, with data presented as mean ± SEM and a significance threshold of p &lt; 0.05.</data>
