<node id="Post-Juvenile Β Cell Population">
  <data key="d0">Post-Juvenile Β Cell Population</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The post-juvenile β cell population refers to human β cells in individuals aged 10 years or older, characterized by MAFAHigh:MAFB+ expression, representing a distinct postnatal β cell population.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74fc4f55c8c6d83ebd1d8dba07d90692</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
