<node id="Neonatal Rat Islets">
  <data key="d0">Neonatal Rat Islets</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Neonatal rat islets are normally non-glucose-responsive and MafALow, but inducing MafA expression in these islets increases GSIS.</data>
