<node id="Homodimeric MAFB Activator">
  <data key="d0">Homodimeric MAFB Activator</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The homodimeric MAFB activator is a form of MAFB that may provide unique functional characteristics to human islet β cells, distinct from the MAFA:MAFB heterodimeric activator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74fc4f55c8c6d83ebd1d8dba07d90692</data>
