<node id="MAFA:MAFB Heterodimeric Activator">
  <data key="d0">MAFA:MAFB Heterodimeric Activator</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The MAFA:MAFB heterodimeric activator is a complex formed between MAFA and MAFB proteins, proposed to provide unique functional characteristics to human islet β cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-74fc4f55c8c6d83ebd1d8dba07d90692</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
