<node id="Glucose Tolerance Testing (GTT)">
  <data key="d0">Glucose Tolerance Testing (GTT)</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucose tolerance testing is a method used to assess glucose clearance in MafAS64F/+ and wild-type mice at various postnatal time points.</data>
