<node id="Iacovazzo Et Al., 2018">
  <data key="d0">Iacovazzo Et Al., 2018</data>
  <data key="d1">Data</data>
  <data key="d2">A research publication reporting findings on MAFA S64F mutation, including its effects on protein stability, disease prevalence, sex-dependent distribution among carriers, and the mean age at diagnosis of 38 years for both diabetes mellitus and insulinomatosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Iacovazzo et al., 2018 is a cited study referenced for the effects of the MAFAS64F variant on protein stability and phosphorylation.&lt;SEP&gt;A research publication cited multiple times regarding the MAFAS64F variant, its effects on protein stability, and its association with MODY or insulinomatosis in heterozygous human carriers.</data>
