<node id="MafAS64F/S64F Homozygous Mutants">
  <data key="d0">MafAS64F/S64F Homozygous Mutants</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">MafAS64F/S64F homozygous mutant mice display overt diabetes with elevated fasting glucose levels in males, variable phenotype in females, and generally poor postnatal survival, possibly due to severe neurodevelopmental defects.</data>
