<node id="Thermo Fisher Scientific">
  <data key="d0">Thermo Fisher Scientific</data>
  <data key="d1">Organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Thermo Fisher Scientific is a prominent biotechnology and scientific reagent company that serves as a key supplier and manufacturer of a wide range of products used across numerous laboratory and experimental procedures.

In the area of cell biology and tissue processing, Thermo Fisher Scientific provides Tissue-Plus O.C.T. embedding medium, OCT compound, zinc formalin, and Hank's Balanced Salt Solution (HBSS). For cell culture applications, the company supplies Dulbecco's Modified Eagle Medium (DMEM), RPMI-1640 medium, penicillin/streptomycin, and L-glutamine. Additionally, Thermo Fisher Scientific supplies propidium iodide, which is used for live/dead cell discrimination in FACS sorting of mouse islet preparations, as well as in other laboratory experiments.

For RNA and molecular biology workflows, Thermo Fisher Scientific provides TRIzol reagent, the RNAqueous RNA isolation kit, and cDNA synthesis kits (catalog number #4368814), the latter of which is specifically used in RNA processing from human islets. The company also supplies RNase A (catalog number #EN0531) and Proteinase K (catalog number #EO0491), both utilized in chromatin immunoprecipitation (ChIP) sample processing.

Thermo Fisher Scientific further provides reagents for protein analysis and detection, including BCA assay reagents and SuperSignal West Pico Plus chemiluminescent substrate. For gel electrophoresis and related assays, the company supplies EMSA kit components and TBE buffer, as well as secondary antibodies used in various study applications.

In addition to its role as a reagent supplier, Thermo Fisher Scientific is also the manufacturer of the Attune NxT flow cytometer, underscoring its broader presence as both an instrumentation and consumables provider in the life sciences research sector.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-82e08f93585dc5d50ccfbac2feb8d206&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c90235486a0fe738831a720e1f94ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46772cbd15b1e36b4aedeac0a06fd4de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b39e1736c730a00c8edfab90d7dc64da&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-667c57ab63de668da1132b51f1e9f411&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c41952a3f79a76f3315858bb8a14bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e9e53f09e3b38fb66b0f093b0768d32a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-40bbefacfceda2b6335fdb6310e2f7ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e72d8d21ebb3fc252c498fcbfeed6c1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7dd7d21dd9a5aa2ba54defd650b8ebd</data>
