<node id="Estradiol">
  <data key="d0">Estradiol</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Estradiol is a sex hormone that affects islet cell function and was investigated for its role in the sex-biased phenotypes of MafAS64F/+ mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Female gonadal hormone that produces differences in islet function in vivo.&lt;SEP&gt;Female gonadal hormone that influences islet function in vivo through sex-specific blood concentrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Female gonadal hormone producing differences in islet function in vivo.&lt;SEP&gt;Female gonadal hormone with sex-specific blood concentrations that influence islet function in vivo.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-63a4c12087ceb7cec876e14e7fc45727&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c0d05211cf3080af14ec050e5cc97ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3982c3cb7b00162818de82027a853e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0238834380bfb40677324883af3e3004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2496631e25b79859522b657da346b58</data>
