</node>
<node id="Male MafAS64F/+ Islets">
  <data key="d0">Male MafAS64F/+ Islets</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Male MafAS64F/+ islets are pancreatic islets from male mice heterozygous for the MafAS64F mutation, exhibiting upregulated genes associated with aging, senescence, DNA damage response, and SASP.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9977f67772ceb665bdd71b221a2d4234</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778562682</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">34</data>
