  <data key="d11">0.00986367</data>
</node>
<node id="gH2AX">
  <data key="d0">gH2AX</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">gH2AX (phosphorylated histone H2AX) is a marker for DNA double-strand breaks, showing increased immunostaining in 5-week-old MafAS64F/+ male islets but not female islets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9977f67772ceb665bdd71b221a2d4234</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
