  <data key="d11">0.0</data>
</node>
<node id="Lentivirus">
  <data key="d0">Lentivirus</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Lentivirus is the vector used to transduce human EndoC-βH2 cells with MAFAWT or MAFAS64F expression constructs.&lt;SEP&gt;A viral vector used to mediate knockdown of MAFB protein in EndoC-βH2 and EndoC-βH1 β cell lines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9977f67772ceb665bdd71b221a2d4234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b8d7d9156faa43670557fc5e83791e</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.&lt;SEP&gt;Species-specific roles for the MAFA and MAFB transcription factors in regulating islet β cell identity.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778562889</data>
