  <data key="d0">Cytokine-Cytokine Receptor Interaction</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Cytokine-cytokine receptor interaction is a signaling pathway associated with genes upregulated in male MafAS64F/+ islets, contributing to the senescence phenotype.</data>
