  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Female MafAS64F/+ islets are pancreatic islets from female mice heterozygous for the MafAS64F mutation, which largely do not show the senescence markers observed in male islets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9977f67772ceb665bdd71b221a2d4234</data>
