<node id="Immunoblot Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Immunoblot Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Immunoblot analysis is a protein detection method used to confirm MAFAS64F's faster migrating properties and altered expression of senescence markers in EndoC-βH2 cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9977f67772ceb665bdd71b221a2d4234</data>
