<node id="MafAS64F/+ Mouse">
  <data key="d0">MafAS64F/+ Mouse</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">MafAS64F/+ mouse is a mutant mouse model expressing the MAFAS64F variant, used to study sex-dependent effects on β cell health, glucose intolerance, and insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse model harboring the MAFA S64F point mutation showing sex-specific beta cell senescence and diabetes in males.&lt;SEP&gt;Mouse model harboring the MAFA S64F point mutation showing sex-specific beta cell senescence and diabetes in males.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa2caaffb8c37fe000f2af35e115fc27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdd484417981e099a8f308ba0994bcaa</data>
  <data key="d4">Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
