  <data key="d0">Ca2+ Response</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Ca2+ response refers to calcium signaling dynamics in pancreatic islets; MafAS64F/+ male islets show severely blunted glucose-induced Ca2+ responses, while female islets exhibit heterogeneous responder and non-responder populations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa2caaffb8c37fe000f2af35e115fc27</data>
