  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Dynamic perifusion is an experimental method used to study insulin secretion, revealing marked reduction in baseline and stimulated insulin secretion in male compared to female MafAS64F/+ islets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa2caaffb8c37fe000f2af35e115fc27</data>
