  <data key="d0">DDR Response</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">DDR (DNA Damage Response) is a cellular response involved in the progression to senescence, occurring after early cellular insult in the context of MAFAS64F-induced senescence.</data>
