  <data key="d0">Ion Channel</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Ion channel function is dysregulated in MafAS64F/+ mouse islets, contributing to β cell dysfunction and non-responder phenotypes.&lt;SEP&gt;Membrane proteins in islets studied in the context of type 2 diabetes.</data>
