  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Gcgr (glucagon receptor) is a downstream effector of Mnx1 and Pdx1 activation involved in cell signaling, contributing to β cell non-responder dysfunction in MafAS64F/+ islets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa2caaffb8c37fe000f2af35e115fc27</data>
