  <data key="d0">Syt2</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Syt2 (synaptotagmin-2) is a gene involved in secretion whose expression contributes to β cell non-responder dysfunction in MafAS64F/+ islets.</data>
