<node id="Quiescence">
  <data key="d0">Quiescence</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Quiescence is a temporary cell-cycle arrest state, distinguished from senescence in that it is reversible and responsive to mitogenic stimuli, contrasted with the irreversible nature of senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;E47 reprograms human pancreatic cancer cells to a quiescent acinar state with reduced tumorigenic potential.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fa2caaffb8c37fe000f2af35e115fc27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a</data>
