<node id="Senescent Cells">
  <data key="d0">Senescent Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Senescent cells are cells that have undergone terminal senescence, becoming resistant to apoptosis through upregulation of anti-apoptotic proteins and accumulating in tissues, potentially causing aging-related pathology.</data>
