  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Type 2 diabetes islets in which GAST+SST+ copositive cells have been previously observed, similar to findings in MAFBKD EndoC-βH2 cells.&lt;SEP&gt;T2D (Type 2 Diabetes) islets are pancreatic islets from donors with Type 2 Diabetes, characterized by enrichment of GAST+ cells and deficiency in MAFB.&lt;SEP&gt;T2D islets are pancreatic islets from individuals with type 2 diabetes, showing GAST protein in single-cell analyses and reduced MAFA and MAFB levels.</data>
