<node id="Androgen Receptor">
  <data key="d0">Androgen Receptor</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Androgen receptor is a nuclear sex hormone receptor whose interaction with MafA and MAFB may contribute to sex-dependent β cell vulnerability to metabolic stress.&lt;SEP&gt;The androgen receptor is a nuclear and extranuclear receptor for androgens, classified as a sex hormone receptor with diverse functional roles in male physiology. It operates through both nuclear and extranuclear mechanisms, enabling it to regulate a broad range of cellular processes beyond classical genomic signaling.

A key function of the androgen receptor involves its role in pancreatic beta cell biology in males. It amplifies glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1) insulinotropic action in male pancreatic beta cells, enhancing glucose-stimulated insulin secretion primarily through its extranuclear actions. This positions the androgen receptor as an important regulator of fuel homeostasis and insulin secretory capacity in males.

In addition to its role in insulin secretion and GLP-1 signaling pathways, the androgen receptor also influences mitochondrial function within male beta cells, suggesting a broader impact on cellular energy metabolism and beta cell health. This mitochondrial involvement may underpin some of the metabolic regulatory functions associated with androgen signaling in pancreatic tissue.

Overall, the androgen receptor integrates nuclear transcriptional regulation with extranuclear signaling to modulate GLP-1 insulinotropic pathways, glucose-stimulated insulin secretion, mitochondrial function, and fuel homeostasis specifically in male beta cells, highlighting its critical and multifaceted role in male metabolic physiology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d1c90235486a0fe738831a720e1f94ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b67e26d82684726785f1910ba6919cf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-794cb97944fe847e61831fceed4d92ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51601485f0924871a988aae2e5ce30bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0238834380bfb40677324883af3e3004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfd4ac2599dc6d5dc028ad0e83ccf82f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c41ef398df926f1c888f284aff2a98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41db2658ec2709309c04b39b1894e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-822d03d11fbf61e2a25591e2663ef1ca</data>
