<node id="10X Genomics">
  <data key="d0">10X Genomics</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">10X Genomics is the manufacturer of the Chromium Single Cell 3′ Reagent Kits V3 used for single-cell RNA-seq library preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;10X Genomics is the manufacturer of the Chromium Single Cell 3′ Reagent Kits V3 used for single-cell library preparation.&lt;SEP&gt;10X Genomics is a platform (v2 or v3 chemistry) used for single-cell library preparation including droplet-based scRNAseq and snATAC-seq.&lt;SEP&gt;10X Genomics is a droplet-based single-cell sequencing platform using v2 or v3 chemistry, used as a covariate in batch correction.&lt;SEP&gt;Single Cell 3' RNAseq platform technology used to generate single cell transcriptomic libraries from human islet cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Company providing 10x Single Cell 3' RNAseq technology used for single cell RNA sequencing library preparation from human islet cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Barcoded library preparation platform used to generate DNA fragments with P5 sequence, 16nt barcode, and read sequences for snATAC-seq.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform used for single nucleus multiome sequencing (snMultiome-seq) combining ATAC-seq and mRNA sequencing.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform and guidelines used for transposition, barcoding, library construction, and sequencing of single cell multiomics data.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform and protocol provider for single nucleus isolation and multiome ATAC + Gene Expression sequencing from islet cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform providing 10x Single Cell 3' RNAseq technology for single-cell library preparation from islet cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-d1c90235486a0fe738831a720e1f94ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46772cbd15b1e36b4aedeac0a06fd4de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7913917fca6b789f10e2948623ce222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e348a0adb909ac9a245bd8fb1b7b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f42efe8d71d6b6b69c377d2a7c44b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6615f49a664b0e6bfe3dc5ebc25a278f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7d380dafd31120f8a1af317cfb0ab1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af08dcd3bdc472cb74376c18c72cf9f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0178968ab91760930c812723c60d342b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c60bd30a96540afcdba183f8a7aa851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0bf8cd8c8cb69199fb8f9bf6c37e70</data>
