  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">MAFBKO β-like cells are MAFB-deficient β-like cells derived from hESCs that fail to produce insulin despite expressing islet-enriched transcription factors, and a subpopulation produces non–β cell hormones such as SST, PP, and GAST.&lt;SEP&gt;MAFBKO β-like cells are MAFB knockout β-like cells derived from human embryonic stem cells (hESC) that display a GAST+ gene signature analyzed by single-cell RNA-Seq.</data>
