  <data key="d2">CHGA is a gene shared among mouse S961-induced Gast+ cells, human MAFBKO GAST+ β-like cells, and human stomach G cells, representing one of only 3 common genes across all three populations.&lt;SEP&gt;Chromogranin A, an endocrine marker gene significantly enriched in Gast+ cells in S961-treated male mice.&lt;SEP&gt;A beta cell identity and function gene with increased expression in CR beta cells.</data>
