  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Quantitative PCR is a method used to validate gene expression findings from RNA-Seq data in MAFBKD EndoC-βH2 cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Quantitative PCR (qPCR) is a molecular analysis method used to confirm β-cell-specific deletion of Atf6 in the experimental mouse model.&lt;SEP&gt;Quantitative PCR is a molecular biology method used to confirm ~60% reduction of Atf6 mRNA in the islets of Atf6β−/− mice.</data>
