  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">β cell MAF transcription factors (MAFA and MAFB) are regulators that prevent non–β cell hormone gene expression in a species-specific manner, with MafA serving this role in mice and MAFB principally in humans.</data>
