<node id="Glucotoxicity">
  <data key="d0">Glucotoxicity</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Glucotoxicity is a pathological condition caused by chronically elevated glucose levels that reduces MAFA and MAFB protein levels in pancreatic islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxic effect of high glucose on beta cells, causing increases in SA-beta-gal and P16INK4a prevented by mTOR inhibition.</data>
