  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">β cell dedifferentiation is a process associated with markers such as Ngn3, FoxO1, and Aldh1a3, which are not detectable in MafA∆β mice, suggesting MafA deficiency causes loss of β cell identity rather than classical dedifferentiation.</data>
