<node id="RNeasy Micro Kit">
  <data key="d0">RNeasy Micro Kit</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">The RNeasy Micro Kit by QIAGEN was used to isolate RNA from mouse islets.&lt;SEP&gt;A kit from Qiagen used to extract RNA from fixed β-cells, including a column for genomic DNA elimination.&lt;SEP&gt;Qiagen kit used to extract total RNA from 30-50 hand-picked islets for bulk RNA-sequencing</data>
