<node id="E2F1">
  <data key="d0">E2F1</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">E2F1 is a transcription factor that mediates a link between fat and islets to promote β-cell proliferation in response to acute insulin resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcription factor that mediates a link between fat and islets to promote beta-cell proliferation in response to acute insulin resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcription factor involved in cell cycle regulation; participates in Sei1-promoted proliferation through assembly with Cdk4-cyclin D.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcription factor that mediates a link between fat and islets to promote beta-cell proliferation in response to acute insulin resistance.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcription factor involved in cell cycle regulation; participates in Sei1-promoted proliferation through assembly with Cdk4-cyclin D.</data>
