<node id="Insulin Enhancer">
  <data key="d0">Insulin Enhancer</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The Insulin enhancer is a regulatory DNA element whose activity is driven by transcription factors such as MAFA and MAFB, relevant to insulin gene expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory DNA element driving insulin gene transcription, activated by MAFA and MAFB in beta cells.</data>
