<node id="HPAP">
  <data key="d0">HPAP</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Human Pancreas Analysis Program (https://hpap.pmacs.upenn.edu/), the source of scRNA-seq raw data from T1D and healthy donors.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet donor database used for perifusion data and transcriptomic profiling of T2D and non-diabetic donors.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Pancreas Analysis Program dataset providing sample metadata and perifusion data for human islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Pancreas Analysis Program database used to examine islet function and transcriptomics in diabetic and non-diabetic donors.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Pancreas Analysis Program (HPAP), a database of islet perifusion and donor data used for transcriptomic and functional comparisons.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Pancreas Analysis Program dataset providing sample metadata and perifusion data for islet studies.&lt;SEP&gt;Human Pancreas Analysis Program dataset providing human islet scRNA-seq data from non-diabetic donors aged 30-50 years used for cross-species DDR comparison.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e74e3fadd5f43dbb51005345f56dec5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64f42efe8d71d6b6b69c377d2a7c44b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe5b7d8c678cb311e300af3b74f19ed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76049b85888e8e904e7c01de9740d34f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d0bf8cd8c8cb69199fb8f9bf6c37e70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cd7041acf7539c8db67413bcd98f41b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6204b07313b33d741c243f18ce86735</data>
