<node id="T1D (Type 1 Diabetes)">
  <data key="d0">T1D (Type 1 Diabetes)</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">T1D is an autoimmune disease in which macrophages play a significant role in etiology, initiation, and perpetuation.&lt;SEP&gt;T1D is an autoimmune disease involving β-cell destruction, with both early and terminal senescence playing roles in its pathogenesis.&lt;SEP&gt;Type 1 Diabetes, a condition used to categorize human donors in scRNA-seq analysis comparing β-cell gene expression profiles.</data>
