<node id="sXBP1">
  <data key="d0">sXBP1</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Spliced XBP1 (sXBP1) is a transcription factor downstream of IRE1α that targets the UPRE on the Cdkn1a promoter, implicating the IRE1α/sXBP1 axis in Cdkn1a regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;sXBP1 (spliced XBP1) is a transcription factor that is part of the IRE1α/sXBP1 axis of the UPR and directly binds to and regulates Cdkn1a expression.&lt;SEP&gt;sXBP1 is an antibody (Cell Signaling, #82914) used for immunoprecipitation in chromatin immunoprecipitation experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02c41952a3f79a76f3315858bb8a14bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dfde3b4ec67624c5a1e8f788a0f0311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3838ae3de5236c272eda0072cc83f4e</data>
