  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">A wash buffer containing 500mM NaCl used to wash protein-antibody complexes captured on magnetic beads during the ChIP assay.&lt;SEP&gt;High Salt Wash Buffer (500mM NaCl, 1% Triton X-100, 20mM Tris-HCl, pH 8.0, 0.1% SDS and 2mM EDTA) is used to wash beads during immunoprecipitation.</data>
