  <data key="d1">Drug</data>
  <data key="d2">Lipofectamine 2000 (Invitrogen, #11668027) is a transfection reagent used to transfect INS1 832/3 cells with various vectors.&lt;SEP&gt;Transfection reagent used to package lentiviral particles in HEK293T cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02c41952a3f79a76f3315858bb8a14bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b377c464e48f2efecc4b62133585c2f1</data>
