  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">IRE1 (inositol-requiring protein-1) is an ER-membrane localized protein that mediates the unfolded protein response (UPR); its α isoform activation leads to specific splicing of XBP1 mRNA.</data>
