<node id="Atf4">
  <data key="d0">Atf4</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Atf4 is a transcription factor whose translation is specifically induced by PERK; it directs transcription of genes involved in amino acid metabolism and oxidative stress reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;A transcription factor whose translation is specifically induced by PERK; directs transcription of genes involved in amino acid metabolism and oxidative stress reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;An ER stress response gene targeted by MAFA in HFD beta cells.</data>
