  <data key="d0">Autoimmune Process</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The autoimmune process refers to the immune-mediated destruction of pancreatic β-cells that causes T1D, in which β-cells actively participate in their own destruction.</data>
