  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">PASP (Pro-senescence Associated Secretory Phenotype) is a secretome that alters macrophage phenotype and includes components such as CXCL14.&lt;SEP&gt;Pro-aging secretory phenotype markers measured in β-cells as indicators of senescence-associated secretory activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23c7b10bcd96e1a6a6ea025a643b2b01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f797167cb0737019ee587d4f66f13530</data>
