<node id="Leukemia Inhibitory Factor (LIF)">
  <data key="d0">Leukemia Inhibitory Factor (LIF)</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">A cytokine whose recruitment to islets is significantly enhanced by the altered β-cell secretome resulting from early senescence; mediates M2 macrophage recruitment.&lt;SEP&gt;LIF is a well-established macrophage attractant that is markedly upregulated in β-cells of UPR-deficient mice and contributes to M2 macrophage recruitment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23c7b10bcd96e1a6a6ea025a643b2b01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18ba6ed2ada6acd593e0a5d2f036f947</data>
