  <data key="d0">Anti-LIF Neutralizing Antibody</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Anti-LIF neutralizing antibody is used to block LIF activity, significantly reducing macrophage migration and M2 macrophage infiltration in UPR-deficient mice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23c7b10bcd96e1a6a6ea025a643b2b01</data>
