</node>
<node id="SA-β-Gal (Senescence-Associated β-Galactosidase)">
  <data key="d0">SA-β-Gal (Senescence-Associated β-Galactosidase)</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">SA-β-gal is a widely used biomarker of terminal senescence, with its activity measured using C12FDG as a fluorescent surrogate substrate.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23c7b10bcd96e1a6a6ea025a643b2b01</data>
  <data key="d4">Stress-induced β cell early senescence confers protection against type 1 diabetes.</data>
