  <data key="d0">G0/G1 Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">G0/G1 phase is a stage of the cell cycle associated with cell cycle arrest, analyzed in UPR-deficient mice as an indicator of terminal senescence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23c7b10bcd96e1a6a6ea025a643b2b01</data>
