  <data key="d2">M1 macrophages are a polarized macrophage phenotype whose polarization is impacted by the PASP component CXCL14.&lt;SEP&gt;M1 macrophages are a proinflammatory macrophage phenotype identified in flow cytometry as CD45+/F4/80+/CD11c+/CD206− cells.</data>
