<node id="P21 (Cdkn1a)">
  <data key="d0">P21 (Cdkn1a)</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">A protein encoded by Cdkn1a, markedly increased in β-cells of Atf6β−/− mice at 5 and 10 weeks and in Ire1αβ−/− mice at 5 weeks; a key senescence and cell cycle arrest marker important for β-cell survival.&lt;SEP&gt;A cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitor involved in cell cycle arrest, senescence, and stress responses; overexpression in beta cells improves recovery from streptozotocin-induced diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-40e720fe9c9efb2c2c2dedf6638ae8f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d13aa78bf917b6b3ed2e772b6f010e3</data>
