  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The Unfolded Protein Response (UPR) is a cellular stress response pathway involving sensors ATF6, IRE1α, and PERK that regulates gene expression including p21/Cdkn1a.&lt;SEP&gt;The Unfolded Protein Response (UPR) is a cellular stress signaling pathway; its selective loss in NOD mice induces early senescence and influences macrophage polarization in pancreatic islets.</data>
