  <data key="d0">P-CREB</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">P-CREB is the phosphorylated active form of CREB whose binding to the Cdkn1a promoter and Sik1 is increased by forskolin and decreased by constitutively active ATF6.&lt;SEP&gt;p-CREB is an antibody (Millipore #06–519) used for immunoprecipitation in chromatin immunoprecipitation experiments.</data>
