<node id="Western Blot">
  <data key="d0">Western Blot</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Western blot is a method used to confirm the efficacy of p21 inhibition by UC2288 and to assess protein expression levels in islet experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Western blot method used to detect protein-level markers of beta-cell senescence including ATM and gamma-H2A.X.&lt;SEP&gt;Western blot method used to detect protein-level markers of beta-cell senescence including ATM and gamma-H2A.X.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein analysis method used to assess levels of p16, p19, and p21 in beta-TC-6 cells following CX-5461 treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Method used to analyze senescence-associated protein expression (p16, p21, p53) following TIF-IA depletion in beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Method used to analyze expression of p16, p19, and p21 proteins in β-TC-6 cells following CX-5461 and KU60019 treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Western blotting analysis performed on cell lysates to evaluate protein expression following nucleolar stress induction.&lt;SEP&gt;Western blot is a protein detection method used to analyze expression of ATM, p-ATM, p16, p19, p21, and p53 in beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8dfde3b4ec67624c5a1e8f788a0f0311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ad905d1d148d4bbfe7ce4c29566fc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f008854d459401e11c35e6bd2541318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de2a35f76e08d5b7cddadbcc01954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af17b436ff0aa3dd562bbc7e986cc909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f082082b0871749ee637b1571aa95c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a0590fd9be1db550e8a84c0781e8955</data>
