<node id="Beta-Cells">
  <data key="d0">Beta-Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Beta-cells are insulin-producing cells in the pancreatic islets that are targeted by autoimmunity in T1D; their survival may be influenced by early senescence mechanisms and UPR signaling.</data>
