<node id="Senescent Hepatic Stellate Cells">
  <data key="d0">Senescent Hepatic Stellate Cells</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Senescent hepatic stellate cells secrete SASP that attracts macrophages and promotes M1 macrophage polarization, which then eliminates senescent cells and supports an antitumor microenvironment.</data>
