<node id="IL-10">
  <data key="d0">IL-10</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">IL-10 is an anti-inflammatory cytokine produced by M2 macrophages; its production is significantly limited in long-standing T1D patients compared to new-onset T1D children.&lt;SEP&gt;Cytokine whose expression in macrophages is controlled by c-MAF, involved in the differentiation of regulatory T cells.&lt;SEP&gt;A cytokine SASP factor robustly upregulated in injury-induced senescence mouse models in the lung.</data>
