  <data key="d0">Homeostasis</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Homeostasis refers to the stable internal state of tissues; its re-establishment is a goal of transient senescence and immune-mediated clearance of senescent cells.</data>
