<node id="FOXO1">
  <data key="d0">FOXO1</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">FoxO1 is a transcription factor that protects against pancreatic β cell failure through induction of NeuroD and MafA.&lt;SEP&gt;FoxO1 is a gene marker associated with β cell dedifferentiation that is not detectable in MafA∆β mice of either sex.&lt;SEP&gt;An insulin-sensitive transcription factor with increased activation in CR beta cell gene regulatory networks.</data>
