<node id="INS1">
  <data key="d0">INS1</data>
  <data key="d1">Gene</data>
  <data key="d2">INS1 (Insulin 1) is a mouse gene that encodes insulin and plays a central role in pancreatic β-cell function and insulin secretion. It is expressed in pancreatic islets and serves as a key marker for assessing β-cell regulatory activity.

INS1 expression is transcriptionally regulated by both MafA and MafB transcription factors. Its expression is reduced upon deletion or dysfunction of either of these factors. Specifically, INS1 mRNA expression is decreased in 3-week-old MafaΔpanc islets, and its expression levels are also diminished in A0B2 and A0B0 islets compared to wild-type (WT) islets, indicating that both MafA and MafB contribute to the maintenance of normal INS1 transcription in β-cells. INS1 has also been identified as a target gene of MAFA through gene expression analysis conducted in pancreatic islets of Mafa-knockout ICR mice.

Beyond straightforward knockout models, INS1 expression is implicated in β-cell dysfunction observed in MafAS64F/+ islets, where its altered expression contributes to a "non-responder" phenotype related to impaired insulin secretion. This highlights INS1's functional relevance not only as a transcriptional target but also as a contributor to β-cell secretory capacity.

Methodologically, INS1 expression is quantified by quantitative real-time PCR (qRT-PCR) using specified primer sequences in pancreatic islet samples. It has been analyzed as part of postnatal time course studies examining MafA's regulatory role in β-cell development and maturation. Collectively, INS1 represents a critical downstream indicator of transcription factor activity in pancreatic β-cells, and its reduced expression serves as a reliable readout of impaired MafA or MafB function in murine models.&lt;SEP&gt;Insulin gene upregulated in CR beta cells as part of beta cell identity gene expression.&lt;SEP&gt;INS1 is a beta cell identity and function marker gene with higher expression in CR state 2 beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5af2ab88dac4e2b983a277be1a9c536&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f67b6052ac2da6848aaabbd71f9d4d53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ee443fb4c37f27d6895254d3f95c708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45b0e9a843120dd461f5ba7ec823e41f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7568462935971fd17472cf21ed7b8a2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb31cc9ec659a6d29b2ec1e3870fb57b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa2caaffb8c37fe000f2af35e115fc27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b1a171c046b7e074fd282a07d58cc39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f02465fe113dd488219949222d1430e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0178968ab91760930c812723c60d342b</data>
