<node id="MNX1">
  <data key="d0">Mnx1</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">The permanent neonatal diabetes gene whose inactivation switches insulin-producing β-cells to a δ-like fate and reveals a facultative proliferative capacity in aged β-cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Mnx1 is a transcription factor whose expression is diminished in both male and female MafAS64F/+ islets, serving as a marker of β cell maturation.</data>
