<node id="MAFB_S70A">
  <data key="d0">MAFB_S70A</data>
  <data key="d1">Mutation</data>
  <data key="d2">MAFB_S70A, also referred to as MAFB Ser70Ala, is a pathogenic mutant of the transcription factor MAFB characterized by a serine-to-alanine substitution at position 70 within the amino-terminal transcriptional activation domain. This mutation is associated with multicentric carpotarsal osteolysis (MCTO), a condition linked to a cluster of mutations occurring in the trans-activation domain of MAFB.

At the molecular level, MAFB_S70A lacks the key phosphosite at serine 70, rendering it an underphosphorylated variant of MAFB. The substitution blocks serine 70 phosphorylation by preventing a priming kinase from acting at that residue, resulting in reduced overall phosphorylation. In partial phosphorylation mimicry models, MAFB_S70A is studied in contexts where residues 54, 58, 62, and 66 are excluded from phosphomimetic substitution, further highlighting the specific role of S70 in the phosphorylation cascade.

Despite these biochemical alterations, structural predictions using AlphaFold 2 indicate no significant structural differences between MAFB_S70A and wildtype MAFB, suggesting the pathogenic effects arise from functional rather than gross conformational changes. Functionally, MAFB_S70A retains similar binding capacity to the INS enhancer and MAFB recognition elements (MARE) compared to wildtype MAFB. Notably, when acting in concert with GLIS3, MAFB_S70A provides additional transcriptional stimulation beyond that observed with wildtype MAFB.

MAFB_S70A has been employed as a research tool in multiple structural and functional studies involving full-length MAFB mutants, including analyses of its impact on cooperative transcriptional activation with ISL1 and PDX1. These investigations collectively aim to elucidate the structural and functional consequences of pathogenic transactivation domain mutations in MAFB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8b5b330edc0a8ae22148338c6d94f154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6515ae53fc7e07b1c44a83258c3224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb32288d5dedac1b23370508bf2f7b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84ba2041af7b71a5fc2faad1de1c95dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3384cef9855a1b408c68f7d1ea3153c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb3c400fe73c10974d8a6b3b2160b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4fecd9e508da1daa4a0d2d27a7e759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fff7a7048ab7112926e25c2e46450b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d07a2e48a0133bedad1b6e79e652b89c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae638e9cabe91a68fc062c9981b0e86</data>
