  <data key="d0">CARMA1</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">Scaffold protein that acts as an essential regulator of NF-κB and activates c-MAF expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Signaling protein in the CARMA1-IKKβ cascade required for activation of c-Maf in T cells.</data>
