  <data key="d2">Sodium-glucose cotransporter 2 gene directly regulated by transcription factor c-MAF in the context of diabetic nephropathy.&lt;SEP&gt;SGLT2 is a glucose transporter expressed in the proximal tubules of kidneys, regulated by C-MAF.&lt;SEP&gt;SGLT2 (encoded by SLC5A2) mediates hyperglycemia-induced cellular senescence in proximal tubules in early diabetic nephropathy.</data>
