  <data key="d2">Intestinal epithelial cell whose zonation and nutrient uptake transcriptional programs are coordinated by c-MAF.&lt;SEP&gt;Enterocytes are intestinal cells that interact with tuft cells to accelerate long-term intestinal accommodation in C-MAF-mediated recovery.</data>
