<node id="lens">
  <data key="d0">lens</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Eye tissue whose development and fiber cell differentiation are regulated by c-Maf and L-MAF.&lt;SEP&gt;The lens is an eye tissue where C-MAF plays a role in differentiation of epithelial cells into fiber cells; abnormal structure leads to cataracts.&lt;SEP&gt;Tissue in the eye where MAF transcription factors contribute to development and differentiation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tissue of the eye in which MAF transcription factors play active roles in development and differentiation.</data>
