  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Tissue in which c-MAF coordinates enterocyte zonation and nutrient uptake transcriptional programs.&lt;SEP&gt;The intestine is a tissue where C-MAF promotes epithelial cell differentiation during recovery from acute injury.&lt;SEP&gt;Intestinal tissue involved in inter-organ crosstalk affecting beta cell function, including gut microbiome-mediated effects.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0be98cbe29b4c692e555154146fad640&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02381256ec5732a712b97ced237c2acb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5596e00050d9f0135f87252a0093e9cb</data>
