<node id="MARE sequence">
  <data key="d0">MARE sequence</data>
  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">MARE sequences are target gene regulatory sequences that C-MAF normally binds to; mutations in the DNA-binding site of C-MAF prevent this binding.&lt;SEP&gt;MAF recognition element DNA sequence to which MAFB normally binds; binding is abolished by MAFB p.Leu239Pro mutation.&lt;SEP&gt;Consensus MAF recognition element sequence used as a target binding sequence in gel shift assays to evaluate DNA-binding capacity of MAF proteins.</data>
