<node id="MAF transcription factors">
  <data key="d0">MAF transcription factors</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">MAF transcription factors are a family of proteins expressed across multiple organs, involved in various diseases including multiple myeloma and insulinoma.&lt;SEP&gt;Family of transcription factors including c-MAF, MAFA, and MAFB, whose point mutations cause multiple human diseases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a91f8726a8e590e31edad7232b84804b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe670890a826e2e1970f382c46b77260</data>
