</node>
<node id="mesangiocapillary glomerulopathy">
  <data key="d0">mesangiocapillary glomerulopathy</data>
  <data key="d1">Disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Mesangiocapillary glomerulopathy is a renal disease associated with increased concentration of albumin in urine, linked to pathogenic variants of C-MAF.&lt;SEP&gt;Renal disease observed in a c-MAF point-mutation human case with high urine albumin concentration.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a91f8726a8e590e31edad7232b84804b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe670890a826e2e1970f382c46b77260</data>
