  <data key="d2">Albumin is a protein whose increased concentration in urine is associated with mesangiocapillary glomerulopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;Serum protein used in fibrinogen/albumin ratio associated with arterial stiffness in type 2 diabetes patients.</data>
