<node id="monocyte">
  <data key="d0">monocyte</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Immune cell type whose differentiation is induced by MAFB.&lt;SEP&gt;Monocytes are immune cells whose differentiation is stimulated by overexpression of MAFB.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-classical monocyte subset with a pro-inflammatory phenotype attributed to senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune cell that is a predominant producer of SASP factors and shows age-related dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Monocytes are immune cells that internalize human islet EVs, contributing to T cell activation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02381256ec5732a712b97ced237c2acb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-222f634a871d4f5fd5cffac2fce0d698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a471400d67fa8643230222fb3576486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff588c6efe73ecb07c6b95acb392e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32fd907a01d621388ff41b9b47bfa34</data>
