  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">MAF recognition element; DNA regulatory sequence whose dependent transcriptional regulation is determined by the abundance of small MAF proteins.&lt;SEP&gt;MAF consensus binding sequence (MAF Recognition Element); binds WT and pathogenic mutant MAF proteins with similar affinity.&lt;SEP&gt;MAF recognition element probe used in EMSA experiments to study MAFA and MAFB DNA binding.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-02381256ec5732a712b97ced237c2acb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb3c400fe73c10974d8a6b3b2160b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fff7a7048ab7112926e25c2e46450b</data>
