  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">C1Q is a complement component essential for phagocytosis of foreign substances and dead cells, whose expression is regulated by MAFB.&lt;SEP&gt;Complement component regulated by MAFB as a critical regulator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-222f634a871d4f5fd5cffac2fce0d698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6515ae53fc7e07b1c44a83258c3224</data>
