<node id="hematopoietic stem cell">
  <data key="d0">hematopoietic stem cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Stem cell type in which MAFB restricts M-CSF-dependent myeloid commitment divisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Hematopoietic stem cells undergo myeloid commitment, a process in which MAFB is involved.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cells rejuvenated in aged mice following clearance of senescent cells by ABT263.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cells that give rise to blood cells; mentioned in the context of senescent cell targeting in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cells rejuvenated in aged mice following clearance of senescent cells by ABT263.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cells that give rise to blood cells; mentioned in the context of senescent cell targeting in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Stem cells in the bone marrow whose aging and senescence are studied in the context of bone marrow niches, and which are rejuvenated by senolytic ABT263.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-222f634a871d4f5fd5cffac2fce0d698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6515ae53fc7e07b1c44a83258c3224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c72c144fce7d5c94557af956a559639&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c7bb3e4a69884a1b79485b95f6f502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe</data>
