<node id="foam cell">
  <data key="d0">foam cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Cell type whose apoptosis is inhibited by MAFB, promoting atherosclerosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Foam cells are macrophage-derived cells in atherosclerotic lesions whose apoptosis is inhibited by MAFB-controlled AIM expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipid-laden macrophage-derived cells forming the intima in atherosclerosis; senescent foam cells are deleterious at all stages of atherosclerosis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-222f634a871d4f5fd5cffac2fce0d698&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed6515ae53fc7e07b1c44a83258c3224&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe</data>
