<node id="insulin sensitivity">
  <data key="d0">insulin sensitivity</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Insulin sensitivity refers to the degree of responsiveness of peripheral tissues to insulin, a key physiological parameter in metabolic regulation and overall health.

Multiple descriptions highlight that insulin sensitivity is significantly enhanced by caloric restriction (CR). In the context of CR, peripheral tissues become more responsive to insulin, which reduces circulating insulin levels and lowers the metabolic demand placed on pancreatic beta cells for insulin release. This enhanced responsiveness helps maintain euglycemia with less insulin output, thereby contributing to beta cell health and longevity. Evidence from CR mouse models, including male mice, demonstrates this effect, with enhanced peripheral insulin sensitivity observed as a consistent outcome of reduced caloric intake.

Beyond caloric restriction, insulin sensitivity has been associated with familial longevity, suggesting a heritable component to this metabolic trait. The improvement in insulin sensitivity under CR conditions is further linked to increased cellular longevity and reduced overall metabolic stress, positioning it as an important factor in aging and lifespan regulation.

Insulin sensitivity also exhibits notable sex-based differences. Adult premenopausal women demonstrate higher insulin sensitivity compared to men, indicating that sex hormones or related physiological factors may play a modulatory role in determining tissue responsiveness to insulin.

In summary, insulin sensitivity is a multifaceted metabolic trait influenced by dietary factors such as caloric restriction, genetic predispositions linked to familial longevity, and biological sex. Its enhancement is broadly associated with reduced burden on beta cells, improved metabolic efficiency, and potential contributions to cellular and organismal longevity.&lt;SEP&gt;Cellular responsiveness to insulin; improved following bariatric surgery.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8304b17dc893b8c9bfb7bfdb03703396&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2e4a544176811f5b43952b185e1ed3a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-364a12c675ebfd67c468ab6fc47e6696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002f23b1d29df711e839459b4d6f0711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363f3a19905f833d29a7d1242acc6641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d286ee457150be65228790e800b5207b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddac43d21e0426c8d61d02d10c0cb772</data>
