<node id="beta cell maturation">
  <data key="d0">beta cell maturation</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Process of functional maturation of pancreatic beta cells; suggested to be induced by p16Ink4a Cdk-inhibitor activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Process of functional maturation of pancreatic beta cells; suggested to be induced by p16Ink4a Cdk-inhibitor activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta cell maturation involves a shift to a quiescent, long-lived phenotype and may involve programmed DNA breaks for modulating transcriptional responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Process controlled by the Wnt/PCP pathway underlying beta cell heterogeneity.&lt;SEP&gt;A process that some studies report is enhanced by beta cell senescence, paradoxically improving insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcriptional and functional maturation process of pancreatic beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Process of beta cell functional maturation; neonatal islets show lower expression of beta-cell maturation markers compared to adult islets.</data>
