<node id="SoupX">
  <data key="d0">SoupX</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">SoupX is a computational software tool designed to remove ambient RNA contamination from droplet-based single-cell RNA sequencing (scRNAseq) data. It was developed by the Young Lab and addresses a common technical artifact in droplet-based single-cell experiments, where ambient RNA from lysed or damaged cells can contaminate droplets and introduce noise into gene expression measurements.

The core function of SoupX involves correcting for ambient RNA signals detected in empty droplets, ensuring that such contaminating RNA is removed from nuclei-containing droplets prior to downstream analysis. This correction is applied to raw feature barcode matrices, making it an essential preprocessing step in single-cell RNA sequencing workflows.

SoupX has been referenced in use across large-scale studies, including applications involving all 52 donors, where it was employed to correct ambient RNA contamination in the corresponding raw sequencing data. Two closely related versions of the tool have been documented in the literature: version 1.6.0, which was used specifically to remove ambient RNA signal detected in empty droplets from nuclei-containing droplets, and version 1.6.1, which was applied for ambient RNA correction across multi-donor single-cell datasets. The minor version difference suggests iterative refinement of the tool over time, though both versions serve the same fundamental purpose.

Overall, SoupX is a widely utilized bioinformatics tool in the single-cell genomics community, providing a robust computational method for improving data quality by mitigating the confounding effects of ambient RNA contamination in droplet-based scRNAseq experiments.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78c6090d91c84168c42d7ba3a2808633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3982c3cb7b00162818de82027a853e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7913917fca6b789f10e2948623ce222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0238834380bfb40677324883af3e3004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c60bd30a96540afcdba183f8a7aa851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41db2658ec2709309c04b39b1894e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e348a0adb909ac9a245bd8fb1b7b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ddf6c13fee09d00987476aa3c478</data>
