<node id="Harmony">
  <data key="d0">Harmony</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Harmony is a computational software tool designed for the fast, sensitive, and accurate integration of single-cell data. It is widely used in single-cell genomics workflows, particularly for batch correction across diverse datasets.

The tool, most notably at version 0.1.1 (with an earlier version 0.1 also documented), performs batch correction by accounting for multiple sources of technical variation. Covariates used in its correction framework include donor library identity, 10X Genomics chemistry, and tissue source, enabling robust harmonization of datasets generated under differing experimental conditions. In some applications, Harmony has been applied specifically to single-nucleus ATAC sequencing (snATAC-seq) datasets, using donor library identity as the primary covariate to mitigate inter-donor technical variability.

Harmony has also been employed for batch correction across datasets spanning as many as 15 donors, demonstrating its scalability for large, multi-donor studies. Additionally, it has been used to correct independent biological replicates, further highlighting its versatility across a range of experimental designs in single-cell research.&lt;SEP&gt;Computational tool for fast, sensitive and accurate integration of single-cell data.&lt;SEP&gt;Software tool (v0.1.1) from Raychaudhuri Lab used for batch correction and integration of single-cell data.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmony 0.1.1 is a batch correction tool used to correct datasets using donor library identity, 10X genomics chemistry, and tissue source as covariates.&lt;SEP&gt;Batch correction tool (v0.1.1) used to correct for donor library identity differences across 15 snATAC datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;Computational method for fast, sensitive, and accurate integration of single-cell data.&lt;SEP&gt;Harmony V1.2.4 is used to integrate in-house and published adult murine single-cell RNA sequencing datasets.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78c6090d91c84168c42d7ba3a2808633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3982c3cb7b00162818de82027a853e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bcdcae8f65f7440848eed5a2448750b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6615f49a664b0e6bfe3dc5ebc25a278f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7913917fca6b789f10e2948623ce222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0238834380bfb40677324883af3e3004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c60bd30a96540afcdba183f8a7aa851&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9c41ef398df926f1c888f284aff2a98e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e348a0adb909ac9a245bd8fb1b7b7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ddf6c13fee09d00987476aa3c478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-835fc8c5c19bf30c115aefbeec789479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce72a72ed1aaea72aac97c28374f8f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c461d96db4bed849ef22472fc2b0cd0</data>
