<node id="Leiden algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Leiden algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Clustering algorithm used at a resolution of 6 for hyperclustering single cell data, resulting in 17 discrete clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Leiden algorithm is a clustering method used at a resolution of 6 to hyperclustered single-cell data resulting in 17 discrete clusters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Leiden algorithm is a clustering method applied at a resolution of 6 for hyperclustering of single-cell RNA sequencing data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-78c6090d91c84168c42d7ba3a2808633&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7913917fca6b789f10e2948623ce222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5e348a0adb909ac9a245bd8fb1b7b7b</data>
