<node id="differential gene expression">
  <data key="d0">differential gene expression</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Statistical analysis performed to identify marker genes across cell types, sexes, races, and disease types using pseudobulked RNA count data and DESeq2.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical approach used to identify sex- and race-associated gene expression differences across islet cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;Analysis of gene expression differences between cell populations performed using Seurat on single cell RNA sequencing data.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential gene expression (DEG) analysis is performed across pancreatic cell types, donors, sex, race, and disease type using DESeq2 on aggregated pseudobulked RNA count data.&lt;SEP&gt;DEGs used to annotate 17 cell clusters in the integrated islet atlas based on known transcriptional signatures of islet cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;Differential gene expression (DEG) analysis is performed to identify cell type-specific marker genes and evaluate statistical differences based on race, sex, and disease across donors.</data>
