<node id="clusterProfiler">
  <data key="d0">clusterProfiler</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">clusterProfiler is a bioinformatics software tool and R package (version 4.4.4) developed by the He Lab, designed as a universal enrichment tool for interpreting omics data.

At its core, clusterProfiler serves as a comprehensive solution for gene set enrichment analysis and functional pathway annotation. It supports gene set enrichment analyses using curated resources such as the MSigDB C5 human gene ontological terms, making it applicable across a wide range of omics datasets, including islet cell data.

A key analytical feature of clusterProfiler is its use of the hypergeometric statistical test for over-representation analysis (ORA) of gene ontology (GO) pathways. This approach enables researchers to identify biological pathways and gene ontology terms that are statistically over-represented within a given gene list, facilitating the interpretation of functional significance in genomic and transcriptomic studies. The tool has been notably applied in the analysis of gene ontology pathways in specific biological contexts, such as islet cell types.

Overall, clusterProfiler integrates multiple analytical capabilities — including gene ontology analysis, pathway enrichment analysis, and functional annotation — into a single, unified R package, making it a widely adopted resource in the bioinformatics community for interpreting complex omics datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;Universal enrichment tool used for interpreting omics data.&lt;SEP&gt;ClusterProfiler V4.0 is an R package used for GSEA with the Gene Ontology Biological Process dataset in islet cell studies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8ee38120968aa57daae758d9f758edfb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3982c3cb7b00162818de82027a853e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6615f49a664b0e6bfe3dc5ebc25a278f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a50ca1b65c7c406b024588b964cb7d22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0238834380bfb40677324883af3e3004&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d41db2658ec2709309c04b39b1894e48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd4f6cfb9180aade52c8cb84446ced85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87d48756321bdf8ef533359c0655a3d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da10e6374cdbd3d6e4a07d773cd172d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e42c3b77d3170e854edbbc691159609d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5804ddf6c13fee09d00987476aa3c478&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2efc110efa119e343b95df1abbd0a327&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c6115fe960d3cc141101692d3cf027c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce72a72ed1aaea72aac97c28374f8f86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c461d96db4bed849ef22472fc2b0cd0</data>
