<node id="T cell">
  <data key="d0">T cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">T cells are a fundamental class of adaptive immune cells that play diverse and critical roles across multiple biological contexts, including immunity, aging, and disease.

As adaptive immune cells, T cells are central to the control of certain B-cell malignancies. Specifically, T cells regulate senescence-prone B-cell lymphomas harboring MYD88 or CARD11 mutations, underscoring their role in tumor immunosurveillance. Additionally, T cells can be activated by beta cell-derived extracellular vesicles (EVs) through memory responses in peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) obtained from donors with Type 1 Diabetes (T1D), highlighting their involvement in autoimmune disease mechanisms.

T cells are also prominently implicated in the biology of cellular senescence and aging. They undergo senescence in murine visceral adipose tissue, a process that is accelerated by obesity, linking metabolic dysfunction to immune aging. T cells express p16INK4a as a recognized biomarker of human aging, yet they retain the capacity for supernumerary cell division and exhibit notable longevity. More broadly, T cells are an immune cell type in which elements of cellular senescence are particularly prominent during immunosenescence — the age-related decline in immune function. When T cells become senescent, they contribute to immunopathology, suggesting that their dysfunctional states can drive harmful inflammatory or immune dysregulation processes.

Furthermore, T cells are an immune cell type in which the epigenetic regulator KDM6A promotes sex differences in biology, indicating that T cell function and behavior can differ between biological sexes through epigenetic mechanisms.

Collectively, T cells occupy a central position at the intersection of adaptive immunity, cellular senescence, metabolic disease, autoimmunity, and sex-based biological differences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fe5b7d8c678cb311e300af3b74f19ed6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-794cb97944fe847e61831fceed4d92ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a471400d67fa8643230222fb3576486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b02375738a9ebacd53446fec2077ee76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ff588c6efe73ecb07c6b95acb392e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32fd907a01d621388ff41b9b47bfa34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ea44d17d2377f3dd0f15239a73e15e4</data>
