  <data key="d1">Gene</data>
  <data key="d2">Genes that escape X chromosome inactivation and are expressed from both alleles in XX cells; conserved between mouse and humans; several are epigenetic remodelers.&lt;SEP&gt;X-escape genes are X chromosome genes that escape inactivation and are expressed from both alleles in XX cells; they are conserved between mouse and humans and include epigenetic remodelers.</data>
