<node id="gene set enrichment analysis">
  <data key="d0">gene set enrichment analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Knowledge-based approach used to interpret genome-wide expression profiles and identify suppressed pathways in sex-specific beta cell DEGs.&lt;SEP&gt;Analytical method used to identify sex-specific changes in pathways related to sex chromosome genes in islet cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Computational method used to identify sex-specific pathway changes related to sex chromosome genes in islet cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge-based approach for interpreting genome-wide expression profiles used in islet cell analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge-based approach for interpreting genome-wide expression profiles, implemented in tools such as Enrichr and MSigDB.&lt;SEP&gt;Statistical method used to identify sex-specific pathway enrichment in islet cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;GSEA, a computational method used to reveal upregulation of nucleolar stress gene sets in senescent islet cells.</data>
