<node id="beta cell failure">
  <data key="d0">beta cell failure</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Dysfunction and failure of insulin-producing beta cells, observed more often in males in both T1D and T2D contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysfunction of pancreatic beta cells contributing to diabetes, with sex-specific heterogeneity in males and females.&lt;SEP&gt;Severe loss of beta cell function prevented by estrogen receptor activation in rodent models.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysfunction and loss of pancreatic beta cell function; observed preferentially in males across multiple forms of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Loss of beta cell function associated with T2D; males are more prone to beta cell failure than females, and ketosis-prone diabetes involves severe beta cell failure.&lt;SEP&gt;Advanced loss of beta cell function associated with upregulated UPR and ER stress pathways under glucolipotoxic conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Failure of pancreatic beta cells driven by the intersection of developmental programming, genetic factors, and environmental challenges.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6c0d05211cf3080af14ec050e5cc97ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3982c3cb7b00162818de82027a853e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-51601485f0924871a988aae2e5ce30bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2496631e25b79859522b657da346b58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-822d03d11fbf61e2a25591e2663ef1ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5596e00050d9f0135f87252a0093e9cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c63b5ad461844f8e5d9a90f5dfc52f1e</data>
  <data key="d4">Single cell regulatory architecture of human pancreatic islets suggests sex differences in β cell function and the pathogenesis of type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex-specific regulatory architecture of pancreatic islets from subjects with and without type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;The role of the beta cell in type 2 diabetes: new findings from the last 5 years.&lt;SEP&gt;Developmental control of DNA damage responses in α- and β-cells shapes the selective beta-cell susceptibility in diabetes.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778571447</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">23</data>
  <data key="d8">Type 2 Diabetes / Insulin Resistance / High-Fat Diet</data>
