<node id="epigenetic programming">
  <data key="d0">epigenetic programming</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Testicular testosterone-induced epigenetic changes during male development that may influence islet function.&lt;SEP&gt;Epigenetic programming caused by testicular testosterone during development may contribute to sex-specific differences in islet biology.&lt;SEP&gt;Process caused by testicular testosterone during male development, influencing sex-specific islet cell function.&lt;SEP&gt;Epigenetic changes during development that may impact beta-cell genomic integrity and health.&lt;SEP&gt;Developmental process caused by testicular testosterone in males that may drive sex differences in islet biology.</data>
