  <data key="d2">Signaling pathway involved in stimulating insulin secretion; decreased in non-diabetic black male islets compared to white male islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Intracellular signaling pathway potentially impaired in CR beta cells, suggested by reduced insulin release with high glucose and IBMX treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Cyclic AMP generation pathway in beta cells potentially impaired in caloric restriction conditions affecting insulin release.</data>
