<node id="estrogen receptor">
  <data key="d0">estrogen receptor</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">Sex hormone receptor that affects mitochondrial function in female beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Estrogen receptor is a sex hormone receptor that affects mitochondrial function in female beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Nuclear receptor whose activation reduces lipid synthesis in pancreatic islets and prevents beta cell failure in rodent models of T2D; also protects beta cells from apoptosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Nuclear receptor for estrogens that regulates fuel homeostasis and is an emerging target for diabetes and obesity treatment.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex hormone receptor that affects mitochondrial function in female beta cells.</data>
