  <data key="d2">Brain support cells including astrocytes and microglia; clearance of senescent glial cells prevents tau-dependent pathology and cognitive decline.&lt;SEP&gt;Non-neuronal cell type in the CNS exhibiting senescence markers in age-associated and neurodegeneration-associated contexts.</data>
