  <data key="d2">Cell type in the central nervous system that exhibits overexpression of senescence-related markers in ageing and disease.&lt;SEP&gt;Specialized progenitor cells that undergo differentiation triggered by cell cycle arrest during lineage refinement, requiring effective DDR for healthy pool maintenance.</data>
