<node id="Alzheimer's disease">
  <data key="d0">Alzheimer's disease</data>
  <data key="d1">Disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Alzheimer's disease is a neurodegenerative disease associated with tau neuropathology and cellular senescence in brain neurons.&lt;SEP&gt;Neurodegenerative disease associated with amyloid beta, tau pathology, astrocyte senescence, microglial senescence, oligodendrocyte progenitor cell senescence, and cerebrovascular senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Neurodegenerative disease for which senolytic therapy was evaluated in a phase 1 feasibility trial.&lt;SEP&gt;Degenerative disease associated with aging and loss of normal cell and tissue function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-732255e9544dde6a7dbc319c61cd8e1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345</data>
  <data key="d4">SenNet recommendations for detecting senescent cells in different tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Exploring senescence as a modifier of β cell extracellular vesicles in type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Calorie restriction increases insulin sensitivity to promote beta cell homeostasis and longevity in mice.</data>
