<node id="tau">
  <data key="d0">tau</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">Tau is a protein involved in neuropathology found in senescent neurons and associated with Alzheimer's disease and cerebrovascular senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein whose aggregation is associated with cellular senescence in the brain, and whose pathology is linked to cerebrovascular senescence, HMGB1 release, and profiled in senescent neurons.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe</data>
