  <data key="d11">0.01214466</data>
</node>
<node id="brain">
  <data key="d0">brain</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The brain is a tissue in which senescent cells including neurons with CDKN2D/p19 and tau neuropathology have been profiled.&lt;SEP&gt;Organ affected by senescent myeloid cell infiltration, neurodegeneration, and multiple forms of cellular senescence studied across neurodegenerative diseases.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe</data>
