<node id="CD38">
  <data key="d0">CD38</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">CD38 is an ecto-enzyme in immune cells induced during aging that regulates NAD+ and NMN levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein upregulated in adipose immune cells by SASP factors from senescent cells, leading to decreased NAD+ levels.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce1a7b385e0f22ca823c850de9bf8a0</data>
