  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">NAD+ is a metabolic cofactor regulated by CD38 ecto-enzyme during aging.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic molecule whose levels decrease as CD38 is upregulated by SASP factors, resulting in increased metabolic dysfunction.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce1a7b385e0f22ca823c850de9bf8a0</data>
