<node id="CDKN1B">
  <data key="d0">CDKN1B</data>
  <data key="d1">Gene</data>
  <data key="d2">CDKN1B encodes p27, a cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitor whose expression is regulated in different adipose tissue depots during aging and obesity.&lt;SEP&gt;Cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitor 1B (p27), a cell cycle regulator identified in peripheral mononuclear blood cells linked to ageing and chronic diseases.&lt;SEP&gt;mRNA levels increase in kidney cortex with ageing; protein expression correlates with age only in cortical tubular cells.</data>
