<node id="hepatic stellate cell">
  <data key="d0">hepatic stellate cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Hepatic stellate cells are liver cells whose senescence limits liver fibrosis and whose senescent form promotes liver regeneration through IL-6 and ligands of CXCR2.&lt;SEP&gt;Liver cell type exhibiting senescence-associated markers such as SA-β-gal activity and expression of Cdkn1a, Cdkn2a and SASP components in models of liver injury.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b773584b36e5b4845bedffea9a1b6add</data>
