<node id="lung">
  <data key="d0">lung</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The lung is a tissue in which p16–3MR model is used to study cellular senescence in cigarette smoke-induced injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;The lung is affected by cellular senescence across the age spectrum, in fibrosis, COPD, emphysema, and injury models.&lt;SEP&gt;An organ in which CDKN2A is the predominant senescence marker and various senescence-related diseases occur.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b773584b36e5b4845bedffea9a1b6add&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a</data>
