</node>
<node id="cigarette smoke">
  <data key="d0">cigarette smoke</data>
  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">Cigarette smoke induces lung injuries associated with cellular senescence studied using the p16-3MR model.&lt;SEP&gt;Cigarette smoke induces lung injuries, senescence, and emphysema studied in p16-3MR mouse models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a</data>
