<node id="p16-3MR">
  <data key="d0">p16-3MR</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">p16–3MR is a novel model used to study cellular senescence in cigarette smoke-induced lung injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;p16-3MR is a novel transgenic model system used to study and clear cellular senescence in cigarette smoke-induced lung injuries and emphysema.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a</data>
