  <data key="d0">p21-Cre mouse</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">An inducible p21-Cre mouse model is used to monitor and manipulate p21-highly-expressing senescent cells in vivo.&lt;SEP&gt;A genetic mouse model using p21-Cre to enable ablation of senescent cells expressing p21 for studying beta cell senescence.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-184abd4f45a78238743890eb9d4f8c56</data>
