  <data key="d0">Mdr2 knockout mouse</data>
  <data key="d1">Organism</data>
  <data key="d2">Mdr2 knockout (Mdr2−/−) mice are a mouse model used to study fibrosis treated with BCL-XL inhibitors targeting senescent cholangiocytes and activated fibroblasts.</data>
