<node id="p19">
  <data key="d0">p19</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">Protein encoded by CDKN2D, identified in senescent neurons alongside tau neuropathology in human brains.&lt;SEP&gt;p19 is encoded by CDKN2D and is found in senescent neurons in human brains associated with tau neuropathology.&lt;SEP&gt;p19 is a senescence-associated protein analyzed by western blot in beta cells following nucleolar stress and ATM inhibition treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Senescence marker protein analyzed by Western blot in β-TC-6 cells following CX-5461 and KU60019 treatments.&lt;SEP&gt;Established senescence marker protein whose levels are significantly increased in beta-TC-6 cells following CX-5461 exposure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a0590fd9be1db550e8a84c0781e8955&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de2a35f76e08d5b7cddadbcc01954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f082082b0871749ee637b1571aa95c0</data>
