  <data key="d0">p27</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">p27 (encoded by CDKN1B) is a cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitor whose expression is regulated in different adipose tissue depots during aging and obesity.</data>
