<node id="basement membrane">
  <data key="d0">basement membrane</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">The basement membrane is a tissue structure where sentinel p16INK4a+ cells form a reparative niche.&lt;SEP&gt;Sentinel p16INK4a+ cells in the basement membrane form a reparative niche in the lung.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a</data>
