<node id="visceral adipose tissue">
  <data key="d0">visceral adipose tissue</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Visceral adipose tissue is a fat depot where obesity accelerates T cell senescence in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Tissue source of extracellular vesicle miR-27a-5p that impairs beta-cell insulin secretion and causes glucose intolerance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71a6a7a3a4894dbd7d979b7e5766d5a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e181574d19e6f17c0fd64b0feecf8f9e</data>
