<node id="aorta">
  <data key="d0">aorta</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Mouse aortic tissue used to reveal multiple novel pathways regulated by aging via transcriptome analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Major blood vessel in which aging-regulated pathways were analyzed by transcriptome analysis in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;The aorta shows upregulation of senescence markers including Cdkn2a, Cdkn1a, Trp53, DNA damage foci, and SASP factors during vascular ageing.&lt;SEP&gt;Major blood vessel in which senescence-associated markers are upregulated during ageing in mice.</data>
