  <data key="d0">SADS</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Senescence-associated distension of satellites (SADS) is a senescence marker accumulating in mouse cardiomyocytes during normal ageing.&lt;SEP&gt;Senescence-associated distension of satellites, a senescence marker observed in aged mouse hepatocytes.&lt;SEP&gt;Senescence-associated distension of satellites, increased in osteocytes with age.&lt;SEP&gt;Senescence-associated distension of satellites, a histological marker used to observe skeletal cellular senescence.</data>
