  <data key="d2">Vascular dysfunction caused by senescence-induced oxidative stress and aging-related DNA damage, linked to cGAS–STING pathway.&lt;SEP&gt;Endothelial dysfunction is a feature of vascular ageing alongside arterial thickening and stiffness.</data>
