<node id="lipofuscin">
  <data key="d0">lipofuscin</data>
  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">Pigment detected by Sudan Black B staining as a marker of senescent cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Autofluorescent aggregate of oxidized proteins, lipids and metals that accumulates in lysosomes of senescent cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Age-related pigment present in adult and old tubular cells in the kidney medulla and some cortical tubules in old kidneys.&lt;SEP&gt;Age-related pigment accumulating in senescent cells in the epidermis and dermis as a senescence marker.&lt;SEP&gt;Aggregates of oxidized proteins and lipids accumulating in senescent cells, used as a senescence marker in ovaries and trophoblasts.&lt;SEP&gt;Aging pigment that accumulates in postmitotic cells including beta cells, used as an age marker.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipofuscin bodies accumulate in aging beta cells with impaired autophagic flux and may contribute to compromised beta cell function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca844018665036149579ef01b8f9ec3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ce1a7b385e0f22ca823c850de9bf8a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5bb73f6c7980a9f906f42f6e0e9ce27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b02375738a9ebacd53446fec2077ee76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f25c34949789593e96b7a57ead73f11&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f39153d9f864070e17a74724a6c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f63ca40b092870f725a75e7a36045d8</data>
  <data key="d4">SenNet recommendations for detecting senescent cells in different tissues.&lt;SEP&gt;Calorie restriction increases insulin sensitivity to promote beta cell homeostasis and longevity in mice.</data>
  <data key="d5">1778569409</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">3</data>
  <data key="d8">cellular senescence / CDKN2A / CDKN1A</data>
