<node id="oxidative metabolism">
  <data key="d0">oxidative metabolism</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Heightened energy-producing metabolic process in senescent cells that sustains ATP-consuming proteo-stress pathways vital for their survival.&lt;SEP&gt;High oxidative metabolism in both neurons and beta cells contributes to their susceptibility to DNA breaks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ca844018665036149579ef01b8f9ec3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de697a7536ea955d878a95580bf8aa11</data>
