  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">mTOR is part of the PI3K-mTOR signaling pathway involved in attenuating senescence in COPD.&lt;SEP&gt;A metabolic signaling molecule that regulates rRNA synthesis, potentially linking metabolic stress to nucleolar stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Kinase whose inhibition prevents glucotoxicity-mediated senescence markers and insulin hypersecretion in pancreatic islets.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanistic target of rapamycin, a metabolic signaling pathway regulator of rRNA synthesis.</data>
