  <data key="d1">Disease</data>
  <data key="d2">Chronic pancreatitis involves adult pancreatic acinar cell dedifferentiation to embryonic progenitor phenotype with senescence activation; unique stellate cell gene signatures are associated with progression from acute to chronic pancreatitis.&lt;SEP&gt;Pancreatic disease in which senescence profile similar to acinar-to-ductal metaplasia is observed.</data>
