<node id="osteoclast progenitor">
  <data key="d0">osteoclast progenitor</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Senescent osteoclast progenitors, when eliminated, have no effect on age-associated bone mass loss in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Precursor cells of osteoclasts; elimination of CDKN2A-expressing osteoclast progenitors did not attenuate age-related bone loss in mice.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7ef738c0840825512b2cb7af5b7c3f6</data>
