<node id="osteocyte">
  <data key="d0">osteocyte</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Bone cells that regulate senescence of bone and bone marrow.&lt;SEP&gt;Osteocytes undergo accelerated senescence in mice with type 2 diabetes, leading to skeletal fragility.&lt;SEP&gt;Mature bone cells with increased SADS, CDKN2A, CDKN1A, TRP53, and numerous SASP transcripts in aged mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Bone-embedded cell in which skeletal cellular senescence is typically observed through SA-β-gal, SADS, and TAF staining.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c5a8121875c37f2659ae345688f6afe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7ef738c0840825512b2cb7af5b7c3f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f25c34949789593e96b7a57ead73f11</data>
