<node id="acinar-to-ductal metaplasia">
  <data key="d0">acinar-to-ductal metaplasia</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Acinar-to-ductal metaplasia is a cellular transformation process limited by p21WAF1/Cip1 during pancreatitis.&lt;SEP&gt;Process by which dedifferentiated acinar cells acquire a senescent state with cell cycle arrest, induction of p53, CDKN1A, CDKN2A, and SA-β-gal activity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7ef738c0840825512b2cb7af5b7c3f6</data>
