<node id="bone loss">
  <data key="d0">bone loss</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Age-related bone loss is targeted by senescent cell clearance strategies; focal radiotherapy-related bone loss is alleviated by senescent cell burden reduction.</data>
