<node id="senescent cell clearance">
  <data key="d0">senescent cell clearance</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Targeted clearance or elimination of senescent cells is used therapeutically to prevent bone loss, diabetes, and other age-related conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Immune-mediated removal of senescent cells; impaired clearance can exacerbate beta-cell stress.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b0125512b4fa44926ba8a80a62b0a6</data>
