  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Premature aging is induced by the MAFA S64F variant in male islet beta cells, causing sex-biased dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Condition associated with DNA damage and repair defects, and induced by MAFA S64F variant in males.&lt;SEP&gt;Accelerated aging phenotype induced in male beta cells by MAFA S64F variant.</data>
