<node id="ovary">
  <data key="d0">ovary</data>
  <data key="d1">Tissue</data>
  <data key="d2">Reproductive tissue that undergoes age-associated fibrosis, increased stiffness, macrophage polarization changes, and cellular senescence prior to primordial follicle depletion.&lt;SEP&gt;Organ that ages earlier than others, exhibiting senescence, inflammation, and fibrosis; studied extensively in animal models.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5bb73f6c7980a9f906f42f6e0e9ce27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf5aeca434044079720fd4ae2d32c9b9</data>
