  <data key="d2">Process of new neuron formation, impaired by neuroblast senescence and augmented natural killer cell cytotoxicity in the aged brain.&lt;SEP&gt;Process referenced in the context of NEUROG3 and ketosis-prone diabetes pathogenesis.&lt;SEP&gt;5-Hydroxymethylcytosine-mediated active demethylation is required for mammalian neuronal differentiation and function.</data>
