  <data key="d11">0.0003457</data>
</node>
<node id="somatic hypermutation">
  <data key="d0">somatic hypermutation</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Somatic hypermutation is supported by BER-mediated SSBs in lymphocytes and enables antibody class switching.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-de697a7536ea955d878a95580bf8aa11</data>
  <data key="d4">Safeguarding genomic integrity in beta-cells: implications for beta-cell differentiation, growth, and dysfunction.</data>
