<node id="GLIS3">
  <data key="d0">GLIS3</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes-associated gene with increased expression in HFD beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;GLIS3 is a diabetes-associated gene with increased expression in diet-specific beta-cell changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet-enriched transcription factor that can bind to the Insulin gene; cooperatively functions with both MAFA and MAFB to stimulate Insulin-reporter activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet-enriched transcription factor that cooperates with MAFA and MAFB to regulate Insulin gene expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcription factor cotransfected with MAFA and MAFB in cell culture assays to evaluate insulin enhancer activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Islet-enriched transcription factor identified as a shared regulator recruited by both MAFAWT and MAFBWT; analyzed for functional interactions with MAF proteins.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f02465fe113dd488219949222d1430e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0178968ab91760930c812723c60d342b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb3c400fe73c10974d8a6b3b2160b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fff7a7048ab7112926e25c2e46450b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d07a2e48a0133bedad1b6e79e652b89c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae638e9cabe91a68fc062c9981b0e86</data>
