  <data key="d2">Single-cell regulatory network inference and clustering method used for gene regulatory network analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;SCENIC is a TF inference tool applied to single beta cell snMultiome-seq data to infer TF-gene linkages and create cell type-specific GRNs.&lt;SEP&gt;Computational method used to reconstruct diet-specific beta cell gene regulatory networks and infer transcription factor activity.</data>
