<node id="protein homeostasis">
  <data key="d0">protein homeostasis</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Maintenance of protein quality and turnover, enhanced by caloric restriction and associated with reduced ER stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein homeostasis mechanisms are enhanced in CR beta cells as part of the transcriptional changes triggered by caloric restriction.&lt;SEP&gt;Cellular process maintaining protein folding and quality control, linked to MAFA, ATF6, and CREBL2 activity in CR beta cells.</data>
