  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Dietary intervention; daily fasting improves health and survival in male mice independent of diet composition and calories.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic state that drives the molecular, metabolic, and geroprotective effects of a calorie-restricted diet in mice.&lt;SEP&gt;Prolonged periods without food intake during caloric restriction necessary for beneficial metabolic effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Short periods of fasting induce autophagy that targets mature insulin granules, in contrast to caloric restriction which does not target them.</data>
