<node id="mitophagy">
  <data key="d0">mitophagy</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Selective autophagy of mitochondria; CR reduces beta cell mitophagy to increase mitochondria mass and ATP generation potential.&lt;SEP&gt;Cellular process enriched in CR beta cells based on pathway enrichment analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Selective autophagy of mitochondria; decreased in CR beta cells as evidenced by lower SDHA-LAMP1 colocalization and lower PRKN expression.&lt;SEP&gt;Selective autophagic degradation of mitochondria; CR reduces beta cell mitophagy, increasing mitochondrial density.&lt;SEP&gt;Selective autophagy of mitochondria; reduced in CR beta cells, contributing to higher mitochondrial density.&lt;SEP&gt;Selective autophagy of mitochondria; essential in beta cells due to tight coupling between mitochondrial metabolism and insulin secretion; regulated by CALCOCO2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f0c13c5a18e2c5037815818d22c48a64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002f23b1d29df711e839459b4d6f0711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa01ef8f1657a9890660f864f52123c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0178968ab91760930c812723c60d342b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-044fb2d3ececa99a53eb87d2ee6bf18f</data>
