<node id="MIMS-EM">
  <data key="d0">MIMS-EM</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Correlated high-resolution electron and multi-isotope mass spectrometry pipeline used to identify tissue distribution of long-lived cells and protein complexes.&lt;SEP&gt;Correlated and high-resolution electron and multi-isotope mass spectrometry used to identify tissue distribution of long-lived cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-isotope imaging mass spectrometry correlated with scanning electron microscopy (MIMS-EM) used to quantify cell and protein complex age based on nuclear 15N retention.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-isotope imaging mass spectrometry combined with electron microscopy used to measure beta cell longevity in situ.&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-Isotope Imaging Mass Spectrometry combined with Electron Microscopy, used for in vivo labeling and imaging of mouse tissues to track cell division.&lt;SEP&gt;Correlative multi-isotope mass spectroscopy combined with scanning electron microscopy (MIMS-EM) measures spatially localized isotope concentrations overlaid with high-resolution SEM images.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-364a12c675ebfd67c468ab6fc47e6696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91ed3d214b295f4a8cccdca98b3822e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363f3a19905f833d29a7d1242acc6641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d5c817dce40d1df02e7717bb9598632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c85c9569fee140bfd52fcc0bbfbcc9c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64b61717ec6764bc92fa7c3c5067d345</data>
