  <data key="d0">circadian rhythm</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Biological timing process involved in beta cell maturation, function, and longevity; disruption leads to metabolic effects reversed by time-restricted feeding.&lt;SEP&gt;Biological pathway with TF motifs (ARNTL/BMAL, DBP, TEF, HLF) enriched in CR beta cell chromatin accessibility changes.&lt;SEP&gt;Biological process modulated by transcriptional regulators DBP and BMAL, activated in CR beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Biological timing mechanism activated by the CR protocol's feeding schedule, contributing to metabolic impacts of CR.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-364a12c675ebfd67c468ab6fc47e6696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-002f23b1d29df711e839459b4d6f0711&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f63ca40b092870f725a75e7a36045d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0178968ab91760930c812723c60d342b</data>
