<node id="beta cell aging">
  <data key="d0">beta cell aging</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Age-associated decline in beta cell function including compromised transcription factor expression, reduced KATP channel conductance, impaired autophagy, DNA damage accumulation, and senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Age-associated deterioration of beta cell function and identity, including transcription factor decline and ER stress induction.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta cell aging involves impaired autophagic flux, accumulation of ER stress, and lipofuscin bodies; CR reduces markers of this process.&lt;SEP&gt;Aging process in beta cells; CR is associated with reduced expression of beta cell aging markers.&lt;SEP&gt;Aging process in beta cells characterized by specific molecular markers; expression of aging markers is reduced under CR conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Age-related decline in beta cell function, with markers including LAMNB1, p16/CDKN2A, p21/CDKN1C, and 53BP1, which are downregulated under CR.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-364a12c675ebfd67c468ab6fc47e6696&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75f39153d9f864070e17a74724a6c8c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f63ca40b092870f725a75e7a36045d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-363f3a19905f833d29a7d1242acc6641&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa01ef8f1657a9890660f864f52123c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c85c9569fee140bfd52fcc0bbfbcc9c2</data>
