  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Functional and molecular identity of beta cells maintained by transcription factors and gene regulatory networks, compromised during aging and restored by CR.&lt;SEP&gt;Characteristic gene expression profile of beta cells; CR increases expression of genes related to beta cell identity.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance of beta cell-specific gene expression programs; enriched in CR beta cells and impaired in HFD beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Set of genes and markers defining mature beta cell characteristics, expressed at higher levels in CR beta cells compared to proliferating beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta cell identity regulated by CIB1 and affected by glucolipotoxic stress in type 2 diabetes.</data>
