  <data key="d1">Mutation</data>
  <data key="d2">MAFA mutant with arginine at position 272 substituted by alanine; retains WT-like insulin enhancer and DNA binding activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Arg272Ala variant of MAFA that functions similarly to wild-type protein despite being in the conserved basic region.&lt;SEP&gt;MAFA basic region mutant that retains WT-like transactivation and DNA-binding activity, unlike its analogous MAFB mutant.&lt;SEP&gt;MAFA mutant where arginine 272 is substituted with alanine; shows discrepancy in expected DNA-binding properties compared to other full-length MAFA and MAFB mutants analyzed.</data>
