<node id="HeLa cell">
  <data key="d0">HeLa cell</data>
  <data key="d1">Cell Type</data>
  <data key="d2">Human cervical cancer cell line used to transfect and express WT and mutant MAFA and MAFB proteins for reporter and gel shift assays.&lt;SEP&gt;Cell line used to produce full-length wild-type and mutant MAFA and MAFB proteins for functional analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Human cell line used in transfection and luciferase reporter assays; does not express MAFA, MAFB, PDX1, NEUROD1, ISL1, or GLIS3 at detectable levels.&lt;SEP&gt;Cell line used for dual luciferase reporter assays to evaluate MAFA and MAFB chimeric protein activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Cell line used in transactivation and expression studies due to relative lack of endogenous islet-enriched transcription factors; used to express CMV-driven MAFA, MAFB, PDX1, GLIS3, ISL1, and/or NEUROD1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb32288d5dedac1b23370508bf2f7b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb3c400fe73c10974d8a6b3b2160b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4fecd9e508da1daa4a0d2d27a7e759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d07a2e48a0133bedad1b6e79e652b89c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae638e9cabe91a68fc062c9981b0e86</data>
