  <data key="d0">gel shift assay</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Electrophoretic mobility shift assay used to assess DNA binding of MAFA and MAFB mutants to the insulin control element.&lt;SEP&gt;Method used to analyze DNA-binding activity of full-length MAFA and MAFB and their mutants to Insulin control element DNA.&lt;SEP&gt;Electrophoretic mobility shift assay used to assess binding of WT and mutant MAF proteins to INS enhancer and MARE sequences.&lt;SEP&gt;Method used to evaluate DNA-binding capacity of MAF mutant proteins to enhancer sequences including INS and consensus MARE sequences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eb32288d5dedac1b23370508bf2f7b2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb3c400fe73c10974d8a6b3b2160b23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f4fecd9e508da1daa4a0d2d27a7e759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae638e9cabe91a68fc062c9981b0e86</data>
