<node id="dimerization">
  <data key="d0">dimerization</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Process by which MAF transcription factors form homo- or heterodimers, regulated by phosphorylation within the MAFA N terminus.&lt;SEP&gt;Dimerization is the process by which MAFA and MAFB form homodimers or heterodimers under physiological conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84ba2041af7b71a5fc2faad1de1c95dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3384cef9855a1b408c68f7d1ea3153c1</data>
