  <data key="d1">Molecule</data>
  <data key="d2">The INS enhancer is a cis-acting regulatory element in the insulin gene to which MAFA and MAFB bind to regulate transcription.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulatory DNA element of the Insulin gene to which MAFA and MAFB wild-type and pathogenic mutant proteins bind with similar capacity.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84ba2041af7b71a5fc2faad1de1c95dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb3c400fe73c10974d8a6b3b2160b23</data>
