<node id="C terminal tail">
  <data key="d0">C terminal tail</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">The nonconserved C terminal tail region of MAFA and MAFB that shows differences between the two proteins and is more disordered in MAFAWT and MAFAS64F.&lt;SEP&gt;C terminal structural region of MAFA and MAFB predicted by AlphaFold 2; shown to have the most striking experimental impact, mediating distinct regulatory properties including ISL1 recruitment by MAFB and insulin+ cell formation by MAFA.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84ba2041af7b71a5fc2faad1de1c95dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eae638e9cabe91a68fc062c9981b0e86</data>
