  <data key="d0">N terminal region</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">The N terminal region of MAFA and MAFB that may interact with the longer C terminal tail of MAFAWT and shows greater differences in heterodimers compared to homodimers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-84ba2041af7b71a5fc2faad1de1c95dd</data>
  <data key="d4">Defining unique structural features in the MAFA and MAFB transcription factors that control Insulin gene activity.</data>
