</node>
<node id="DNA binding">
  <data key="d0">DNA binding</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Process by which MAFA and MAFB interact with target DNA sequences, mediated by the bZip domain and regulated by phosphorylation and structural features.&lt;SEP&gt;DNA binding is a functional activity of MAFA and MAFB mediated through the basic-leucine-zipper domain; unphosphorylated MAFA is unable to bind DNA.&lt;SEP&gt;Process by which MAFA and MAFB interact with target gene promoter elements; compromised in basic region mutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Capacity of MAF proteins to bind enhancer sequences; largely intact in mutant MAF proteins as assessed by gel shift assays.</data>
