<node id="hyperglycaemia">
  <data key="d0">hyperglycaemia</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Elevated blood glucose phenotype associated with T2D, with sex-specific differences in pathogenesis suggested by female-only fasting glucose GWAS enrichment.&lt;SEP&gt;Elevated blood glucose levels resulting from insufficient insulin secretion from beta cells in type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Phenotype observed in some Slc30a8 knockout mouse studies, reflecting impaired insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Elevated blood glucose levels driving islet immune cell infiltration and linked to gut microbiome-mediated beta cell dysfunction.</data>
