<node id="beta cell heterogeneity">
  <data key="d0">beta cell heterogeneity</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">The diversity within the beta cell population that leads to differential responses to stress situations, relevant to type 2 diabetes progression.&lt;SEP&gt;Functional diversity among beta cells essential for proper insulin secretion, regulated by the Wnt/PCP pathway and epigenetic mechanisms.&lt;SEP&gt;Existence of distinct beta cell subtypes with different transcriptional, functional, and surface marker profiles; observed in mice and humans.&lt;SEP&gt;Variability among beta cells contributed to by DNA methylation-dependent restriction of tyrosine hydroxylase and other mechanisms.</data>
