  <data key="d2">Gene whose restoration in type 2 diabetic human islets reverses pancreatic beta cell dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphatidylinositol transfer protein alpha (PITPNA) is involved in granule maturation in beta cells, and its restoration is associated with improved secretory capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Phosphatidylinositol transfer protein alpha, involved in granule maturation in beta cells; its restoration is associated with improved secretory capacity.</data>
