<node id="metformin">
  <data key="d0">metformin</data>
  <data key="d1">Drug</data>
  <data key="d2">Diabetes prevention drug studied in long-term follow-up (Diabetes Prevention Program Outcomes Study) for diabetes development and microvascular complications.&lt;SEP&gt;A pharmaceutical agent used in type 2 diabetes management; compared unfavorably to lifestyle intervention in the DPP trial for diabetes incidence reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Metformin is an oral medication used in the management of diabetes in subjects carrying the MAFA p.Ser64Phe variant.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddac43d21e0426c8d61d02d10c0cb772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10bdc47e4d027606476b48a401061a27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-348e687c811009b30863b17f466ac662</data>
