  <data key="d2">Triple agonist of GIP, GLP-1, and glucagon receptors that improves markers of pancreatic beta cell function and insulin sensitivity.&lt;SEP&gt;An incretin-based therapy achieving up to 24% weight reduction while improving beta cell function markers including proinsulin/C-peptide ratios, HOMA-B scores and adiponectin levels.</data>
