<node id="bariatric surgery">
  <data key="d0">bariatric surgery</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">Surgical weight-loss intervention demonstrated to achieve type 2 diabetes remission in clinical trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Surgical weight loss intervention including Roux-en-Y gastric bypass, studied for effects on beta cell function, Ca2+ dynamics, and type 2 diabetes outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic surgical intervention demonstrating superior glycaemic control and higher remission rates vs medical/lifestyle intervention over 7–12 years, with rapid improvements in beta cell calcium signalling.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddac43d21e0426c8d61d02d10c0cb772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43761b34ecc024bd90bfa8711c45a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10bdc47e4d027606476b48a401061a27</data>
