<node id="weight loss">
  <data key="d0">weight loss</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Intervention strategy associated with type 2 diabetes remission, achieved through bariatric surgery or pharmacological means.&lt;SEP&gt;Reduction in body weight studied in the context of type 2 diabetes remission and beta cell recovery in DiRECT and DIADEM-I trials.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustained weight loss is a strategy that can restore beta cell insulin secretory capacity and promote diabetes remission.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustained weight loss that reduces liver and pancreatic fat, suppresses beta cell dedifferentiation, and can induce long-term type 2 diabetes remission.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ddac43d21e0426c8d61d02d10c0cb772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43761b34ecc024bd90bfa8711c45a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-10bdc47e4d027606476b48a401061a27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f09e5d1418f8ae04b43a24b97c1d52d</data>
