<node id="glucolipotoxicity">
  <data key="d0">glucolipotoxicity</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Combined toxic effects of excess glucose and lipids on pancreatic beta cells, contributing to type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Deleterious effect of elevated glucose and fatty acids on beta cell function, proposed to underlie gradual deterioration of insulin secretion in type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Combined toxic effect of high glucose and lipid levels on beta cells, contributing to beta cell dysfunction in type 2 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Glucolipotoxicity is an irreversible form of metabolic stress in beta cells that can be avoided with timely intervention during mild metabolic stress.</data>
