<node id="CX-5461">
  <data key="d0">CX-5461</data>
  <data key="d1">Drug</data>
  <data key="d2">CX-5461 is a pharmacological compound classified as an inhibitor of RNA Polymerase I (Pol I), primarily recognized for its ability to selectively target ribosomal DNA and inhibit Pol I-mediated ribosomal RNA (rRNA) transcription. It is widely used as a chemical inducer of nucleolar stress in experimental research settings.

In cell-based studies, CX-5461 has been employed at concentrations ranging from 100 to 500 nM, typically over a 72-hour treatment period, to induce nucleolar stress and senescence in beta cell lines, including β-TC-6 and INS-1 cells, as well as primary islets. Its effects are concentration-dependent and include the dose-dependent formation of γ-H2AX foci, induction of a pseudo-DNA Damage Response (pseudo-DDR), activation of ATM kinase, and upregulation of key senescence markers such as p53 and p16. CX-5461 also triggers senescence-associated β-galactosidase (β-gal) staining activity in cultured beta cells, further confirming its role in promoting cellular senescence. A standard working concentration of 200 nM has been reported for inducing nucleolar stress in cell lines.

Beyond beta cell research, CX-5461 has been shown to induce a DNA damage response in primary vascular smooth muscle cells and to activate the P53 pathway, underscoring its broader utility in studying DNA damage and stress response mechanisms across different cell types.

Despite its robust effects in vitro, oral administration of CX-5461 to high-fat, high-carbohydrate (HFHC) diet-fed mice failed to induce beta cell nucleolar stress and senescence in vivo, highlighting a notable discrepancy between its in vitro and in vivo efficacy. CX-5461 is used experimentally to investigate beta cell senescence and DNA damage response pathways, and its name has occasionally been misspelled as "CX-54661" inconsistently in some literature.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f008854d459401e11c35e6bd2541318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a0590fd9be1db550e8a84c0781e8955&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bb74bfaf0604b4b9f891e16fc9f0ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce4f6e2d90d0c06e4549d7d45037298&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de2a35f76e08d5b7cddadbcc01954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b377c464e48f2efecc4b62133585c2f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15ab370ab273e97005ced113e59cc48a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af17b436ff0aa3dd562bbc7e986cc909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f082082b0871749ee637b1571aa95c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e33cd1d99c96a7f6ffdd0fbea902670</data>
