<node id="KU60019">
  <data key="d0">KU60019</data>
  <data key="d1">Drug</data>
  <data key="d2">A pharmacological ATM inhibitor that strongly attenuates nucleolar stress-induced beta cell senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;KU60019 is an ATM inhibitor used to block ATM activation and suppress nucleolar stress-induced senescence in beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Pharmacological ATM inhibitor that attenuates nucleolar stress-induced beta cell senescence, restores cell proliferation, and reduces IL-1β and IL-6 levels.&lt;SEP&gt;KU60019 is an ATM inhibitor (CAS: 925701-46-8) used in the study.&lt;SEP&gt;Specific ATM kinase inhibitor used at 3 μM to evaluate the role of ATM kinase in nucleolar stress-induced cellular senescence.</data>
