<node id="vascular degeneration">
  <data key="d0">vascular degeneration</data>
  <data key="d1">Phenotype</data>
  <data key="d2">Vascular disease whose development is promoted by nucleolar stress-induced smooth muscle cell senescence.&lt;SEP&gt;Pathological outcome resulting from nucleolar stress-induced smooth muscle cell senescence via the ATM/ATR-p53 axis upon TIF-IA ablation.&lt;SEP&gt;Vascular degeneration is a phenotype associated with muscle cell senescence mediated via the ATM/ATR-p53 axis.</data>
