  <data key="d0">NPM</data>
  <data key="d1">Protein</data>
  <data key="d2">Nucleophosmin, a hallmark marker of nucleolar stress; shows enhanced diffusion from nucleolus to nucleoplasm under metabolic stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Nucleophosmin, a nucleolar protein that undergoes redistribution in senescent beta cells in vivo as a marker of nucleolar stress.&lt;SEP&gt;Nucleophosmin, a nucleolar protein whose translocation to the nucleoplasm serves as an indicator of nucleolar stress.&lt;SEP&gt;NPM/Nucleophosmin is a nucleolar protein detected by rabbit antibody in the study.</data>
