  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Maintenance of genome integrity, supported by DNA methylation and relevant to DNA damage vulnerability in islet cells.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance of genomic integrity; differentially regulated in alpha and beta cells, with beta cells requiring DNMT3A for protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Maintenance of genome integrity in cells; beta cells and alpha cells show differential dependency on DNA methylation for genomic stability.</data>
