</node>
<node id="M phase">
  <data key="d0">M phase</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Mitotic phase of the cell cycle; alpha cells frequently harbor DNA damage during M phase while beta cells show minimal H2AX in M phase.&lt;SEP&gt;Cell cycle phase showing minimal HFD-induced DDR changes in both alpha and beta cells.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7af94fcbbc3d167377ece712218fa36b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f6204b07313b33d741c243f18ce86735</data>
