</node>
<node id="DSB repair">
  <data key="d0">DSB repair</data>
  <data key="d1">Biological Process</data>
  <data key="d2">Double-strand break repair process that remains active throughout G2 and M phases in both alpha and beta cells via homologous recombination.</data>
