<node id="RNA-Seq">
  <data key="d0">RNA-Seq</data>
  <data key="d1">Method</data>
  <data key="d2">RNA-Seq is used for differential gene expression analysis of islet cells, including paired-end sequencing and alignment to the mouse genome mm10.&lt;SEP&gt;RNA-seq (RNA sequencing) is a high-throughput transcriptomic sequencing method widely used for gene expression profiling and the detection of differentially expressed genes across various biological contexts.

In the context of pancreatic islet cell research, RNA-seq is employed to detect upregulated and differentially expressed genes in islet cells of MafAS64F/+ mice, as well as to measure transcriptome changes in islet cells through single-cell multiome sequencing approaches. For bulk transcriptional profiling of islet cells, RNA-seq data is processed and analyzed using bioinformatics tools including STAR (for read alignment), HTSeq (for read counting), and edgeR (for differential expression analysis).

RNA-seq is also utilized in the study of human beta cell biology and disease modeling. Specifically, it has been applied as a transcriptomic sequencing method to analyze gene expression in MAFBKD EndoC-βH2 cells, with results compared against other GAST+ cell data sets. Additionally, RNA-seq is used to detect transcriptomic changes in senescent beta cells and to identify upregulated genes in human senescence models, underscoring its relevance in understanding cellular aging processes within pancreatic cell populations.

Overall, RNA-seq serves as a versatile and comprehensive tool for characterizing transcriptome-wide changes, enabling researchers to investigate gene regulation, cellular senescence, and disease-associated transcriptional alterations in both mouse and human islet cell systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cbe530a83d027293c37b530e3c376973&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c461d96db4bed849ef22472fc2b0cd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9977f67772ceb665bdd71b221a2d4234&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc00b5dc127eca5ff2847cc45392453&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58ad905d1d148d4bbfe7ce4c29566fc6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f02465fe113dd488219949222d1430e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce72a72ed1aaea72aac97c28374f8f86</data>
