  <data key="d13">Ectopically expressed MafB induces expression from glucagon reporter constructs.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB specifically promotes Glucagon expression and is expressed in glucagon+ α-cells in the adult pancreas.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB regulates glucagon expression in developing α-cells, as evidenced by reduced glucagon expression in MafB−/− embryos.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB acts as an activator of the glucagon gene expressed in developing islet α- and β-cells.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB specifically stimulates glucagon expression in endocrine cells.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB is a critical regulator of glucagon production and secretion in mouse pancreatic α-cells.&lt;SEP&gt;MAFB is critical for glucagon production and secretion in pancreatic alpha cells.&lt;SEP&gt;MAFB regulates glucagon production in pancreatic islet alpha cells.</data>
