<edge source="Pancreatic Islet" target="MAFB">
  <data key="d12">1.0</data>
  <data key="d13">MAFB plays important regulatory roles in pancreatic islet α cells, including hormone production.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB acts in a coordinated manner with MafA to affect islet cell function and development.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB activates genes during mouse embryonic pancreatic development, many of which are later controlled by adult MafA.</data>
  <data key="d14">cellular function,hormone regulation&lt;SEP&gt;embryonic development,gene activation,islet cell development,transcription factor</data>
  <data key="d15">chunk-8b5b330edc0a8ae22148338c6d94f154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7f8610c162035d52f2edbe846e8a97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75261aabfd0eeb269665c62f36dfeb2e</data>
  <data key="d16">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.&lt;SEP&gt;MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.&lt;SEP&gt;Defining unique structural features in the MAFA and MAFB transcription factors that control Insulin gene activity.</data>
  <data key="d17">1778563033</data>
  <data key="d18"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Pancreatic Islet" target="MAFA">
  <data key="d12">1.0</data>
  <data key="d13">MAFA plays important regulatory roles in pancreatic islet β cells, including hormone production.&lt;SEP&gt;MafA expression in pancreatic islet β-cells increases postnatally and is associated with islet architecture maturation, islet cell mass, and glucose-sensitive insulin secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;MafA is indispensable for maintaining normal pancreatic islet architecture and β-cell function in the postnatal period.&lt;SEP&gt;A conserved mechanism of accelerated islet aging and senescence implicates MafA in promoting diabetes in MAFAS64F carriers in a sex-biased manner.</data>
  <data key="d14">cellular function,hormone regulation&lt;SEP&gt;aging,enrichment,islet architecture,transcription factor,transcriptional regulation,β-cell maturation</data>
  <data key="d15">chunk-8b5b330edc0a8ae22148338c6d94f154&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41e9c4875e9ee2b378c620275d81fe7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ee443fb4c37f27d6895254d3f95c708&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f38c4d8fe95ae0a2b5cc05069361348</data>
  <data key="d16">The MafA transcription factor becomes essential to islet β-cells soon after birth.&lt;SEP&gt;MafA and MafB regulate genes critical to beta-cells in a unique temporal manner.&lt;SEP&gt;Defining unique structural features in the MAFA and MAFB transcription factors that control Insulin gene activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
  <data key="d17">1778563033</data>
  <data key="d18"></data>
</edge>
