<edge source="Type 2 Diabetes" target="TM6SF2">
  <data key="d12">4.0</data>
  <data key="d13">TM6SF2 is a T2D risk locus; a variant near it has sex-specific effects on T2D, and an accessible chromatin region in female lymphocytes overlaps with 4 T2D-associated variants at this locus.&lt;SEP&gt;The TM6SF2 locus is near differentially accessible regions overlapping classical T2D variants.&lt;SEP&gt;TM6SF2 is a T2D risk locus with sex-specific effects on T2D, including index variant rs188247550 and nearby variant rs8107974.&lt;SEP&gt;The TM6SF2 locus overlaps with T2D-associated variants, with sex-specific effects reported in trans-ancestry GWAS.</data>
