  <data key="d12">4.0</data>
  <data key="d13">MafB is the primary activator of Slc30a8 expression in both α- and β-cells during embryonic pancreatic development.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB activates Slc30a8, a gene involved in vesicle maturation, as part of mature endocrine function.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB activates Slc30a8-encoded zinc transporter expression in developing α- and β-cells.&lt;SEP&gt;MafB regulates Slc30a8 expression, with compromised expression observed in MafB mutant glucagon+ and insulin+ cells during development.</data>
