<edge source="β Cells" target="GAST+ Cells">
  <data key="d12">2.0</data>
  <data key="d13">GAST+ cells represent a subpopulation of β cells with loosened identity, potentially representing a reprogrammable state that may precede β cell dedifferentiation and T2D development.&lt;SEP&gt;GAST+ cells represent a pool of reprogrammable cells with loosened β cell identity that may be coaxed back to functional β cells.</data>
