<edge source="p16Ink4a" target="cellular senescence">
  <data key="d12">1.0</data>
  <data key="d13">p16Ink4a is a key marker and mediator of cellular senescence, and its positive cells shorten healthy lifespan and delay aging-associated disorders when cleared.&lt;SEP&gt;p16Ink4a is a cyclin-dependent kinase inhibitor involved in mediating senescence-associated stable growth arrest alongside p21Cip1.&lt;SEP&gt;P16INK4A has emerged as a major driver of senescence in a broad range of cell types, established from studies on fibroblast senescence, genetic knockout mice, and cancer.&lt;SEP&gt;P16INK4A is a major driver of senescence across a broad range of cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;P16INK4A is expressed in senescent beta-cells and used as a marker to identify and target them genetically.&lt;SEP&gt;p16INK4a is a key enforcer of irreversible cellular senescence through the Rb pathway.&lt;SEP&gt;p16INK4a is a key biomarker and driver of cellular senescence across multiple tissues including lung, bone, and pancreas.&lt;SEP&gt;p16INK4a expression is used to monitor senescence and tumorigenesis in vivo and is a biomarker of aging.</data>
  <data key="d14">induction,marker&lt;SEP&gt;growth arrest,mediator&lt;SEP&gt;activates,drives,marker_of,regulates&lt;SEP&gt;biomarker,biomarker_of,drives,enforces,regulates</data>
  <data key="d15">chunk-3f64af938dff7c5f186bd7024d92cbc0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea9634b81ecdb467a2b26648246e5b5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ef7d4c1829099c6037d8b8b7a83c3cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b861cee193cad9e0f142051047e83aae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58c0cbc7de7a8a1060e8f1608271a28c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea13fe99fbc01cb6036ecddcda0aae8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b02375738a9ebacd53446fec2077ee76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf5aeca434044079720fd4ae2d32c9b9</data>
  <data key="d16">Stress-induced β cell early senescence confers protection against type 1 diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Sex-biased islet β cell dysfunction is caused by the MODY MAFA S64F variant by inducing premature aging and senescence in males.</data>
  <data key="d17">1778562690</data>
  <data key="d18"></data>
</edge>
