<edge source="SASP" target="alpha cell">
  <data key="d12">3.0</data>
  <data key="d13">SASP from senescent beta cells affects alpha cell function, including altered glucagon secretion in human islets in culture.&lt;SEP&gt;SASP induction in cultured human islets causes changes in glucagon secretion from alpha cells.&lt;SEP&gt;SASP originating from beta cells causes changes in glucagon secretion from alpha cells, impacting their normal functioning.</data>
