<edge source="Type 1 Diabetes (T1D)" target="cellular senescence">
  <data key="d12">1.0</data>
  <data key="d13">Senescent β-cells accumulate during the natural history of T1D, and small molecule targeting of senescence prevents T1D in NOD mice.</data>
