<edge source="beta cell" target="neuron">
  <data key="d12">4.0</data>
  <data key="d13">Beta-cells share many developmental programs with neurons, both being post-mitotic long-lived cell types.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta cells and neurons share a toolbox of expressed genes reflecting their evolutionary relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta-cells share many characteristics with neurons including shared developmental transcriptional regulation and use of membrane depolarization for secretion.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta cells share many characteristics with neurons including vulnerability to DNA breaks and high genomic 5hmC content.</data>
