  <data key="d12">4.0</data>
  <data key="d13">Beta-cell death through apoptosis contributes to depletion of the beta-cell reserve and development of diabetes.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta cell apoptosis is detected by TUNEL assay and expressed as percentage of INS+ cells&lt;SEP&gt;Apoptosis is selectively increased in beta cells of 8-week-old NOD mice compared to alpha cells.&lt;SEP&gt;3aPKO beta cells show increased apoptosis at P7 despite reduced replication.</data>
