<edge source="beta cell" target="time-restricted feeding">
  <data key="d12">2.0</data>
  <data key="d13">Time-restricted feeding prevents deleterious metabolic effects of circadian disruption through epigenetic control of beta cell function.&lt;SEP&gt;Time-restricted feeding prevents deleterious metabolic effects of circadian disruption through epigenetic control of beta cell function.</data>
  <data key="d14">protects</data>
  <data key="d15">chunk-72bf1fbaf7a329c364247108f8b30408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f63ca40b092870f725a75e7a36045d8</data>
  <data key="d16">Safeguarding genomic integrity in beta-cells: implications for beta-cell differentiation, growth, and dysfunction.&lt;SEP&gt;Calorie restriction increases insulin sensitivity to promote beta cell homeostasis and longevity in mice.</data>
