  <data key="d13">XIST is upregulated in female alpha cells as part of sex-specific gene expression differences.&lt;SEP&gt;XIST is upregulated across all female islet cells including α cells.&lt;SEP&gt;XIST is upregulated in female alpha cells compared to male alpha cells.&lt;SEP&gt;XIST is upregulated in female alpha cells.&lt;SEP&gt;XIST is an X-linked gene showing sex differences in chromatin accessibility in alpha cells.</data>
