<edge source="cellular senescence" target="apoptosis">
  <data key="d12">3.0</data>
  <data key="d13">Senescence and apoptosis are described as dueling or complementary cell fates.&lt;SEP&gt;Senescent cells progressively acquire resistance to intrinsic apoptosis.&lt;SEP&gt;Senescence and apoptosis are proposed as complementary cell fates, with senescence favored under irremediable but less severe stress than apoptosis.</data>
