  <data key="d12">2.0</data>
  <data key="d13">Point mutations in C-MAF are associated with Aymé–Gripp syndrome, characterized by intellectual and developmental disabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Mutations in the transcriptional activation domain of C-MAF are causative for Aymé–Gripp syndrome.</data>
