  <data key="d13">Pathogenic variants of C-MAF are associated with increased albumin in urine resulting in mesangiocapillary glomerulopathy.&lt;SEP&gt;A c-MAF point mutation in a human patient caused high urine albumin concentration resulting in mesangiocapillary glomerulopathy.</data>
