<edge source="nucleolar stress" target="CX-5461">
  <data key="d12">7.0</data>
  <data key="d13">CX-5461 is a nucleolar stress inducer that triggers senescence-associated markers in cultured beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;CX-5461 treatment effectively induces nucleolar stress as demonstrated by NPM translocation and rRNA reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;CX-5461 is a chemical nucleolar stress inducer that impairs rRNA synthesis in beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;CX-5461 induces nucleolar stress in beta cells, triggering downstream senescence pathways.&lt;SEP&gt;CX-5461 treatment induces nucleolar stress in beta cells and primary islets.&lt;SEP&gt;CX-5461 is a Pol I inhibitor and chemical nucleolar stress inducer; oral administration failed to induce beta cell nucleolar stress in HFHC diet-fed mice, but in vitro studies confirmed its role as a nucleolar stress inducer.&lt;SEP&gt;CX-5461 is used at 200 nM to induce nucleolar stress in cell lines.</data>
  <data key="d14">induces</data>
  <data key="d15">chunk-6f008854d459401e11c35e6bd2541318&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a0590fd9be1db550e8a84c0781e8955&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bb74bfaf0604b4b9f891e16fc9f0ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ce4f6e2d90d0c06e4549d7d45037298&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-787de2a35f76e08d5b7cddadbcc01954&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af17b436ff0aa3dd562bbc7e986cc909&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f082082b0871749ee637b1571aa95c0</data>
  <data key="d16">Nucleolar stress facilitates islet β cell senescence via hijacking the DNA damage response pathways.</data>
  <data key="d17">1778571205</data>
  <data key="d18"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="nucleolar stress" target="ActD">
  <data key="d12">4.0</data>
  <data key="d13">ActD treatment effectively induces nucleolar stress as demonstrated by NPM translocation and rRNA reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Actinomycin D (ActD) is a chemical nucleolar stress inducer that impairs rRNA synthesis in beta cells.&lt;SEP&gt;ActD induces nucleolar stress in INS-1 cells, associated with γ-H2AX foci formation.&lt;SEP&gt;ActD is used as a nucleolar stress inducer in cell line experiments.</data>
